window.__kcChunk("repo_argocd_s3_helm_main",{"github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_README_md":"<h1>ArgoCD S3 Helm Demo</h1>\n<p>使用 ArgoCD 与 S3 后端 Helm 仓库进行 GitOps 演示，在 EKS 上实现持续交付。</p>\n<h2>架构图</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>开发者工作流</strong>\n<img alt=\"开发者工作流\" src=\"./developer-workflow.png\" /></li>\n<li><strong>GitOps 工作流</strong>\n<img alt=\"GitOps 工作流\" src=\"./gitops-workflow.png\" /></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>架构</h2>\n<p>本项目展示了一套完整的 GitOps 工作流：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ArgoCD</strong>：GitOps 持续交付引擎</li>\n<li><strong>S3</strong>：Helm chart 仓库后端</li>\n<li><strong>EKS</strong>：托管 Kubernetes 集群</li>\n<li><strong>GitHub Actions</strong>：应用的 CI/CD 流水线</li>\n<li><strong>Argo Rollouts</strong>：高级部署策略（蓝绿、金丝雀）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>快速开始</h2>\n<h3>前置条件</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>已配置 AWS CLI</li>\n<li>已安装 kubectl</li>\n<li>已安装 Terraform</li>\n<li><strong>Helm 3.x</strong>（v4 存在兼容性问题）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>0. 将应用推送到 Github</h3>\n<p>创建三个独立的 GitHub 仓库并推送应用代码：</p>\n<h4>后端仓库</h4>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 创建新仓库：your-username/backend\ncd applications/backend\ngit init\ngit add .\ngit commit -m &quot;Initial backend application&quot;\ngit remote add origin https://github.com/your-username/backend.git\ngit push -u origin main\n</code></pre>\n<h4>前端仓库</h4>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 创建新仓库：your-username/frontend\ncd applications/frontend\ngit init\ngit add .\ngit commit -m &quot;Initial frontend application&quot;\ngit remote add origin https://github.com/your-username/frontend.git\ngit push -u origin main\n</code></pre>\n<h4>DevOps 仓库（私有）</h4>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 创建新的私有仓库：your-username/devops\ncd applications/devops\ngit init\ngit add .\ngit commit -m &quot;Initial devops configuration&quot;\ngit remote add origin https://github.com/your-username/devops.git\ngit push -u origin main\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>重要提示</strong>：\n- Backend 和 Frontend 仓库可以是公开的\n- DevOps 仓库必须是私有的（包含敏感配置）\n- 更新 ArgoCD 应用清单中的仓库 URL（<code>argocd/applications/</code>）\n- 为私有仓库访问配置 GitHub App 认证</p>\n<h4>需要进行的配置更新</h4>\n<p>创建仓库后，请使用你自己的具体值更新以下文件：</p>\n<p><strong>仓库 URL：</strong>\n- <code>argocd/applications/backend.yaml</code> - 将 <code>repoURL</code> 更新为你的 backend 仓库\n- <code>argocd/applications/frontend.yaml</code> - 将 <code>repoURL</code> 更新为你的 frontend 仓库\n- <code>argocd/applications/devops.yaml</code> - 将 <code>repoURL</code> 更新为你的 devops 仓库\n- <code>argocd/applications/root.yaml</code> - 将 <code>repoURL</code> 更新为你的 argocd-s3-helm 仓库</p>\n<p><strong>S3 存储桶名称：</strong>\n- <code>charts/setup.sh</code> - 更新 <code>BUCKET_NAME</code> 变量\n- <code>charts/push.sh</code> - 更新 <code>BUCKET_NAME</code> 变量\n- <code>argocd/base/patch/s3-helm-repo-secret.yaml</code> - 更新 S3 URL</p>\n<p><strong>ECR 仓库：</strong>\n- <code>applications/backend/.github/workflows/ci.yml</code> - 更新 ECR registry URL\n- <code>applications/frontend/.github/workflows/ci.yml</code> - 更新 ECR registry URL</p>\n<p><strong>GitHub App 配置：</strong>\n- <code>argocd/base/secrets/github-app-argocd-config</code> - 使用你的 GitHub App 详情进行更新\n- <code>argocd/base/secrets/github-app-devops-config</code> - 使用你的 GitHub App 详情进行更新</p>\n<h3>1. 部署基础设施</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">cd _infra\nterraform init\nterraform apply\n</code></pre>\n<h3>2. 设置集群组件</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">export CLUSTER_NAME=your-cluster-name\nexport AWS_REGION=ap-northeast-2\n./setup/apply.sh\n</code></pre>\n<h3>3. 设置 Helm 仓库</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">cd charts\n./setup.sh\n./push.sh\n</code></pre>\n<h3>4. 部署 ArgoCD</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">kubectl apply -k argocd/base\nkubectl apply -k argocd/applications\n</code></pre>\n<h2>仓库结构</h2>\n<pre><code>├── _infra/                 # Terraform 基础设施\n├── argocd/                 # ArgoCD 配置\n│   ├── base/              # ArgoCD 安装与补丁\n│   └── applications/      # 应用定义\n├── applications/          # 演示应用\n│   ├── backend/           # Python FastAPI 后端\n│   ├── frontend/          # 静态 HTML 前端\n│   └── devops/           # Helm values 与清单\n├── charts/               # Helm chart 模板\n├── setup/               # 集群设置脚本\n└── docs/                # 文档与图表\n</code></pre>\n<h2>GitOps 工作流</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>代码推送</strong>：开发者推送到应用仓库</li>\n<li><strong>CI 流水线</strong>：GitHub Actions 构建并推送 Docker 镜像</li>\n<li><strong>Values 更新</strong>：CI 更新 devops 仓库中的 Helm values</li>\n<li><strong>ArgoCD 同步</strong>：ArgoCD 检测变更并部署</li>\n<li><strong>发布上线</strong>：Argo Rollouts 管理部署策略</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>组件</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>EKS 集群</strong>：基于 Fargate 的托管 Kubernetes</li>\n<li><strong>ArgoCD</strong>：集成 S3 Helm 的 GitOps 控制器</li>\n<li><strong>AWS Load Balancer Controller</strong>：ALB ingress 管理</li>\n<li><strong>Argo Rollouts</strong>：高级部署策略</li>\n<li><strong>Cert Manager</strong>：TLS 证书自动化</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>文档</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_argocd_README_md\" class=\"inlink\">ArgoCD Setup</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_README_md\" class=\"inlink\">Applications Guide</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_README_md\" class=\"inlink\">Helm Charts</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_setup_README_md\" class=\"inlink\">Infrastructure Setup</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_GITHUB_ACTIONS_SETUP_GUIDE_md\" class=\"inlink\">GitHub Actions Setup</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>重要说明</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>仅使用 Helm v3.x（v4 存在兼容性问题）</li>\n<li>确保子网已正确打标签，以便 ALB 自动发现</li>\n<li>私有仓库需要 GitHub App 认证</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>许可证</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>MIT License</li>\n<li>Copyright (c) 2026 Juan Lee <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"deadlink\" title=\"资源/代码文件（资料库内：github-repos-zh/argocd-s3-helm-main/&）\" >&#105;&#97;&#109;&#64;&#106;&#117;&#97;&#110;&#121;&#46;&#100;&#101;&#118;</a></li>\n</ul>","github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_README_md":"<h1>基础设施</h1>\n<p>用于部署支撑 ArgoCD S3 Helm 演示的 AWS 基础设施的 Terraform 模块。</p>\n<h2>架构</h2>\n<pre><code>_infra/\n├── main.tf              # 根模块\n├── provider.tf          # AWS provider 配置\n├── variable.tf          # 输入变量\n├── outputs.tf           # 输出值\n└── modules/\n    ├── networking/      # VPC、子网、安全组\n    ├── container/       # EKS 集群与节点组\n    └── iam/            # IAM 角色与策略\n</code></pre>\n<h2>组件</h2>\n<h3>Networking 模块</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>VPC</strong>：多可用区，含公有/私有子网</li>\n<li><strong>安全组</strong>：EKS 集群与节点安全</li>\n<li><strong>路由表</strong>：互联网与 NAT 网关路由</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Container 模块</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>EKS 集群</strong>：托管 Kubernetes 集群</li>\n<li><strong>节点组</strong>：EC2 与 Fargate 计算</li>\n<li><strong>附加组件</strong>：VPC CNI、CoreDNS、kube-proxy</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>IAM 模块</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>集群角色</strong>：EKS 集群服务角色</li>\n<li><strong>节点角色</strong>：工作节点实例角色</li>\n<li><strong>IRSA 角色</strong>：服务账号角色，用于：</li>\n<li>ArgoCD repo-server（S3 访问）</li>\n<li>AWS Load Balancer Controller</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>部署</h2>\n<h3>1. 配置变量</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">cp terraform.tfvars.example terraform.tfvars\n# Edit terraform.tfvars with your values\n</code></pre>\n<h3>2. 部署基础设施</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">terraform init\nterraform plan\nterraform apply\n</code></pre>\n<h3>3. 配置 kubectl</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">aws eks update-kubeconfig --region &lt;region&gt; --name &lt;cluster-name&gt;\n</code></pre>\n<h2>变量</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变量</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>cluster_name</code></td>\n<td>EKS 集群名称</td>\n<td><code>argocd-demo</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>region</code></td>\n<td>AWS 区域</td>\n<td><code>ap-northeast-2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>vpc_cidr</code></td>\n<td>VPC CIDR 块</td>\n<td><code>10.0.0.0/16</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>node_instance_types</code></td>\n<td>EC2 实例类型</td>\n<td><code>[\"t3.medium\"]</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>输出</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>cluster_name</code>：EKS 集群名称</li>\n<li><code>cluster_endpoint</code>：EKS API 服务器端点</li>\n<li><code>vpc_id</code>：VPC 标识符</li>\n<li><code>private_subnet_ids</code>：私有子网 ID</li>\n<li><code>public_subnet_ids</code>：公有子网 ID</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>部署后操作</h2>\n<p>基础设施部署完成后：\n1. 更新 kubeconfig：<code>aws eks update-kubeconfig --name &lt;cluster-name&gt;</code>\n2. 安装集群组件：<code>../setup/apply.sh</code>\n3. 为 ALB 打子网标签：<code>../setup/tag-subnets.sh</code></p>\n<h2>清理</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">terraform destroy\n</code></pre>\n<p><strong>注意</strong>：销毁基础设施之前，请确保所有 Kubernetes 资源（尤其是 LoadBalancer）均已删除，以避免遗留孤立的 AWS 资源。</p>","github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_GITHUB_ACTIONS_SETUP_GUIDE_md":"<h1>GitHub Actions 设置指南</h1>\n<p>Frontend/Backend CI/CD 流水线设置指南</p>\n<h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>每个应用程序(Frontend/Backend)由独立的 GitHub 仓库管理，遵循以下 CI/CD 流程：</p>\n<pre><code>Code Push → GitHub Actions → Build Docker Image → Push to ECR → Update DevOps Repo → ArgoCD Sync (3min)\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Prerequisites</h2>\n<h3>1. AWS Resources</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>ECR Repositories</strong>：分别为 Backend、Frontend 创建</li>\n<li><strong>IAM User</strong>：具有 ECR push 权限的 GitHub Actions 专用 IAM User</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>2. GitHub Repositories</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>backend</code> - Backend 应用程序代码</li>\n<li><code>frontend</code> - Frontend 应用程序代码</li>\n<li><code>devops</code> - 管理 Helm values 文件 (backend.values.yaml, frontend.values.yaml)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>3. GitHub Personal Access Token</h3>\n<p>需要用于 push 到 DevOps repo 的 PAT：\n- Settings → Developer settings → Personal access tokens → Tokens (classic)\n- Scopes：<code>repo</code> (Full control of private repositories)</p>\n<h2>Repository Structure</h2>\n<h3>Backend Repository</h3>\n<pre><code>backend/\n├── .github/\n│   └── workflows/\n│       └── ci.yml          # CI/CD workflow\n├── Dockerfile              # Docker build 配置\n├── main.py                 # 应用程序代码\n└── requirements.txt        # 依赖\n</code></pre>\n<h3>Frontend Repository</h3>\n<pre><code>frontend/\n├── .github/\n│   └── workflows/\n│       └── ci.yml          # CI/CD workflow\n├── Dockerfile              # Docker build 配置\n└── index.html              # 应用程序代码\n</code></pre>\n<h3>DevOps Repository</h3>\n<pre><code>devops/\n├── backend.values.yaml     # Backend Helm values\n├── frontend.values.yaml    # Frontend Helm values\n├── ingress.yaml            # Shared ingress\n└── kustomization.yaml      # Kustomize config\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Setup Instructions</h2>\n<h3>Step 1: Create ECR Repositories</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># Backend ECR\naws ecr create-repository \\\n  --repository-name backend \\\n  --region ap-northeast-2\n\n# Frontend ECR\naws ecr create-repository \\\n  --repository-name frontend \\\n  --region ap-northeast-2\n</code></pre>\n<h3>Step 2: Create IAM User for GitHub Actions</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># IAM Policy (ecr-push-policy.json)\n{\n  &quot;Version&quot;: &quot;2012-10-17&quot;,\n  &quot;Statement&quot;: [\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;ecr:GetAuthorizationToken&quot;,\n        &quot;ecr:BatchCheckLayerAvailability&quot;,\n        &quot;ecr:GetDownloadUrlForLayer&quot;,\n        &quot;ecr:BatchGetImage&quot;,\n        &quot;ecr:PutImage&quot;,\n        &quot;ecr:InitiateLayerUpload&quot;,\n        &quot;ecr:UploadLayerPart&quot;,\n        &quot;ecr:CompleteLayerUpload&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;*&quot;\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n# Create IAM User\naws iam create-user --user-name github-actions-ecr\naws iam put-user-policy \\\n  --user-name github-actions-ecr \\\n  --policy-name ECRPushPolicy \\\n  --policy-document file://ecr-push-policy.json\n\n# Create Access Key\naws iam create-access-key --user-name github-actions-ecr\n</code></pre>\n<h3>Step 3: Configure GitHub Secrets</h3>\n<h4>Backend Repository Secrets</h4>\n<p>Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → New repository secret</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Secret Name</th>\n<th>Value</th>\n<th>Example</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID</code></td>\n<td>IAM User Access Key</td>\n<td><code>AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY</code></td>\n<td>IAM User Secret Key</td>\n<td><code>wJalrXUtnFEMI/K7MDENG/bPxRfiCYEXAMPLEKEY</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AWS_REGION</code></td>\n<td>AWS Region</td>\n<td><code>ap-northeast-2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ECR_REPOSITORY_BACKEND</code></td>\n<td>ECR Repository Name</td>\n<td><code>backend</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DEVOPS_REPO</code></td>\n<td>DevOps Repository</td>\n<td><code>your-org/devops</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DEVOPS_REPO_TOKEN</code></td>\n<td>GitHub PAT</td>\n<td><code>ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxx</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4>Frontend Repository Secrets</h4>\n<p>Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → New repository secret</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Secret Name</th>\n<th>Value</th>\n<th>Example</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID</code></td>\n<td>IAM User Access Key</td>\n<td><code>AKIAIOSFODNN7EXAMPLE</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY</code></td>\n<td>IAM User Secret Key</td>\n<td><code>wJalrXUtnFEMI/K7MDENG/bPxRfiCYEXAMPLEKEY</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AWS_REGION</code></td>\n<td>AWS Region</td>\n<td><code>ap-northeast-2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ECR_REPOSITORY_FRONTEND</code></td>\n<td>ECR Repository Name</td>\n<td><code>frontend</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DEVOPS_REPO</code></td>\n<td>DevOps Repository</td>\n<td><code>your-org/devops</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>DEVOPS_REPO_TOKEN</code></td>\n<td>GitHub PAT</td>\n<td><code>ghp_xxxxxxxxxxxx</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Step 4: Add Workflow Files</h3>\n<h4>Backend: <code>.github/workflows/ci.yml</code></h4>\n<pre><code class=\"language-yaml\">name: Backend CI to ECR\n\non:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n  push:\n    branches: [ main ]\n\njobs:\n  build-and-push:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout code\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Generate image tag\n        id: tag\n        run: |\n          TIMESTAMP=$(date -u +%Y%m%d%H%M%S)\n          SHORT_SHA=$(echo ${{ github.sha }} | cut -c1-6)\n          IMAGE_TAG=&quot;${TIMESTAMP}-${SHORT_SHA}&quot;\n          echo &quot;IMAGE_TAG=${IMAGE_TAG}&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n          echo &quot;Generated tag: ${IMAGE_TAG}&quot;\n\n      - name: Configure AWS credentials\n        uses: aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v4\n        with:\n          aws-access-key-id: ${{ secrets.AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID }}\n          aws-secret-access-key: ${{ secrets.AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY }}\n          aws-region: ${{ secrets.AWS_REGION }}\n\n      - name: Login to Amazon ECR\n        id: ecr-login\n        uses: aws-actions/amazon-ecr-login@v2\n\n      - name: Build and push image\n        env:\n          ECR_REGISTRY: ${{ steps.ecr-login.outputs.registry }}\n          ECR_REPOSITORY: ${{ secrets.ECR_REPOSITORY_BACKEND }}\n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ steps.tag.outputs.IMAGE_TAG }}\n        run: |\n          docker build -t &quot;$ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG&quot; .\n          docker push &quot;$ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG&quot;\n          echo &quot;Pushed image: $ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG&quot;\n\n      - name: Checkout devops repo\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          repository: ${{ secrets.DEVOPS_REPO }}\n          token: ${{ secrets.DEVOPS_REPO_TOKEN }}\n          path: devops\n\n      - name: Update devops values\n        env:\n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ steps.tag.outputs.IMAGE_TAG }}\n          ECR_REGISTRY: ${{ steps.ecr-login.outputs.registry }}\n          ECR_REPOSITORY: ${{ secrets.ECR_REPOSITORY_BACKEND }}\n        run: |\n          cd devops\n          sed -i &quot;s|tag: .*|tag: ${IMAGE_TAG}|g&quot; backend.values.yaml\n\nsed -i &quot;s|repository: .*|repository: ${ECR_REGISTRY}/${ECR_REPOSITORY}|g&quot; backend.values.yaml\n\n      - name: Commit and push to devops repo\n        env:\n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ steps.tag.outputs.IMAGE_TAG }}\n        run: |\n          cd devops\n          git config --global user.name &quot;github-actions[bot]&quot;\n          git config --global user.email &quot;github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com&quot;\n          git add backend.values.yaml\n          git commit -m &quot;chore: update backend image to ${IMAGE_TAG}&quot; || echo &quot;No changes to commit&quot;\n          git push\n          echo &quot;ArgoCD will sync within 3 minutes&quot;\n</code></pre>\n<h4>Frontend: <code>.github/workflows/ci.yml</code></h4>\n<pre><code class=\"language-yaml\">name: Frontend CI to ECR\n\non:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n  push:\n    branches: [ main ]\n\njobs:\n  build-and-push:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout code\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n\n      - name: Generate image tag\n        id: tag\n        run: |\n          TIMESTAMP=$(date -u +%Y%m%d%H%M%S)\n          SHORT_SHA=$(echo ${{ github.sha }} | cut -c1-6)\n          IMAGE_TAG=&quot;${TIMESTAMP}-${SHORT_SHA}&quot;\n          echo &quot;IMAGE_TAG=${IMAGE_TAG}&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n          echo &quot;Generated tag: ${IMAGE_TAG}&quot;\n\n      - name: Configure AWS credentials\n        uses: aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v4\n        with:\n          aws-access-key-id: ${{ secrets.AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID }}\n          aws-secret-access-key: ${{ secrets.AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY }}\n          aws-region: ${{ secrets.AWS_REGION }}\n\n      - name: Login to Amazon ECR\n        id: ecr-login\n        uses: aws-actions/amazon-ecr-login@v2\n\n      - name: Build and push image\n        env:\n          ECR_REGISTRY: ${{ steps.ecr-login.outputs.registry }}\n          ECR_REPOSITORY: ${{ secrets.ECR_REPOSITORY_FRONTEND }}\n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ steps.tag.outputs.IMAGE_TAG }}\n        run: |\n          docker build -t &quot;$ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG&quot; .\n          docker push &quot;$ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG&quot;\n          echo &quot;Pushed image: $ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG&quot;\n\n      - name: Checkout devops repo\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          repository: ${{ secrets.DEVOPS_REPO }}\n          token: ${{ secrets.DEVOPS_REPO_TOKEN }}\n          path: devops\n\n      - name: Update devops values\n        env:\n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ steps.tag.outputs.IMAGE_TAG }}\n          ECR_REGISTRY: ${{ steps.ecr-login.outputs.registry }}\n          ECR_REPOSITORY: ${{ secrets.ECR_REPOSITORY_FRONTEND }}\n        run: |\n          cd devops\n          sed -i &quot;s|tag: .*|tag: ${IMAGE_TAG}|g&quot; frontend.values.yaml\n          sed -i &quot;s|repository: .*|repository: ${ECR_REGISTRY}/${ECR_REPOSITORY}|g&quot; frontend.values.yaml\n\n      - name: Commit and push to devops repo\n        env:\n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ steps.tag.outputs.IMAGE_TAG }}\n        run: |\n          cd devops\n          git config --global user.name &quot;github-actions[bot]&quot;\n          git config --global user.email &quot;github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com&quot;\n          git add frontend.values.yaml\n          git commit -m &quot;chore: update frontend image to ${IMAGE_TAG}&quot; || echo &quot;No changes to commit&quot;\n          git push\n          echo &quot;ArgoCD will sync within 3 minutes&quot;\n</code></pre>\n<h2>工作流说明</h2>\n<h3>镜像标签格式</h3>\n<pre><code>YYYYMMDDHHMMSS-COMMITHASH\nExample: 20260202143022-a1b2c3\n</code></pre>\n<h3>工作流步骤</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Checkout code</strong>：拉取应用程序代码</li>\n<li><strong>Generate image tag</strong>：使用 Timestamp + Commit hash 生成唯一标签</li>\n<li><strong>Configure AWS credentials</strong>：用于访问 ECR 的 AWS 认证</li>\n<li><strong>Login to ECR</strong>：登录 ECR 镜像仓库</li>\n<li><strong>Build and push image</strong>：构建 Docker 镜像并推送到 ECR</li>\n<li><strong>Checkout devops repo</strong>：拉取 DevOps 仓库</li>\n<li><strong>Update devops values</strong>：更新 values 文件中的 image tag</li>\n<li><strong>Commit and push</strong>：将变更提交并推送到 devops repo</li>\n</ol>\n<h3>ArgoCD 同步</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>DevOps repo 更新后，ArgoCD 会在 <strong>3 分钟内</strong>自动检测到变更</li>\n<li>基于 Pull 的 GitOps 方式（polling interval: 180s）</li>\n<li>通过 Argo Rollouts 进行 Blue-Green 或 Canary 部署</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>测试</h2>\n<h3>手动触发</h3>\n<p>在 GitHub UI 中手动执行：\n1. Repository → Actions → CI workflow\n2. Run workflow → Run workflow</p>\n<h3>自动触发</h3>\n<p>向 <code>main</code> 分支 push 时自动执行：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">git add .\ngit commit -m &quot;feat: update application&quot;\ngit push origin main\n</code></pre>\n<h2>故障排查</h2>\n<h3>ECR 推送失败</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>检查 IAM User 权限</li>\n<li>检查 ECR Repository 是否存在</li>\n<li>检查 AWS Region 是否一致</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>DevOps Repo 更新失败</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>检查 <code>DEVOPS_REPO_TOKEN</code> 权限（需要 repo scope）</li>\n<li>检查 DevOps repository 名称</li>\n<li>检查 values 文件路径（backend.values.yaml、frontend.values.yaml）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>ArgoCD 未同步</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>检查 ArgoCD polling 设置（180s）</li>\n<li>检查 GitHub App 认证（如果是 Private repo）</li>\n<li>检查 Application sync policy（automated: true）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>安全最佳实践</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Secrets 管理</strong></li>\n<li>使用 GitHub Secrets（禁止暴露在环境变量中）</li>\n<li>对 IAM User 应用最小权限原则</li>\n<li>\n<p>PAT 只授予必要的 scope</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Image Tagging</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>基于 Timestamp 的标签便于 rollback</li>\n<li>\n<p>避免使用 <code>latest</code> 标签</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>DevOps Repo</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>仅管理 values 文件（不含敏感信息）</li>\n<li>在 Commit 消息中包含 image tag，以确保可追踪性</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>参考</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.github.com/en/actions\">GitHub Actions Documentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ecr/\">AWS ECR Documentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://argo-cd.readthedocs.io/\">ArgoCD Documentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://argoproj.github.io/argo-rollouts/\">Argo Rollouts Documentation</a></li>\n</ul>","github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_README_md":"<h1>Applications</h1>\n<p>展示 ArgoCD 和 Argo Rollouts 的 GitOps 工作流的演示应用程序。</p>\n<h2>Structure</h2>\n<pre><code>applications/\n├── backend/           # Python FastAPI 后端\n├── frontend/          # 静态 HTML 前端\n└── devops/           # Helm values 和 manifests\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Applications</h2>\n<h3>Backend</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>技术栈</strong>：Python FastAPI</li>\n<li><strong>端口</strong>：8080</li>\n<li><strong>Endpoints</strong>：<code>/api/health</code>、<code>/api/info</code></li>\n<li><strong>Docker</strong>：使用 Python 3.11 的多阶段构建</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Frontend</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>技术栈</strong>：静态 HTML/CSS/JS</li>\n<li><strong>端口</strong>：80</li>\n<li><strong>特性</strong>：调用后端 API 的简单 Web 界面</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>DevOps Configuration</h2>\n<p><code>devops/</code> 目录包含：\n- <strong>Helm Values</strong>：<code>backend.values.yaml</code>、<code>frontend.values.yaml</code>\n- <strong>Manifests</strong>：用于共享 ALB ingress 的 <code>ingress.yaml</code>\n- <strong>Kustomization</strong>：组合 values 和 manifests</p>\n<h2>CI/CD Workflow</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>代码变更</strong>：推送到 backend/frontend 仓库</li>\n<li><strong>GitHub Actions</strong>：</li>\n<li>构建 Docker 镜像</li>\n<li>以时间戳标签推送到 ECR</li>\n<li>更新 devops 仓库中的 values 文件</li>\n<li><strong>ArgoCD Sync</strong>：检测到 values 变更并进行部署</li>\n<li><strong>Argo Rollouts</strong>：管理部署策略</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Deployment Strategies</h2>\n<p>应用程序通过 Argo Rollouts 支持多种部署策略：\n- <strong>Rolling Update</strong>：默认策略\n- <strong>Blue-Green</strong>：零停机部署\n- <strong>Canary</strong>：渐进式流量切换</p>\n<p>在 Helm values 中配置策略：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-yaml\">rollout:\n  strategy: blueGreen  # 或 canary、rolling\n</code></pre>\n<h2>GitHub Actions Setup</h2>\n<p>详细的 CI/CD 配置请参阅 <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" data-doclink=\"github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_GITHUB_ACTIONS_SETUP_GUIDE_md\" class=\"inlink\">GITHUB_ACTIONS_SETUP_GUIDE.md</a>。</p>\n<h2>Accessing Applications</h2>\n<p>部署后，应用程序可通过共享 ALB ingress 访问：\n- <strong>Frontend</strong>：<code>http://&lt;alb-dns&gt;/</code>\n- <strong>Backend API</strong>：<code>http://&lt;alb-dns&gt;/api/</code></p>","github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_devops_README_md":"<h1>DevOps 应用配置</h1>\n<p>本目录包含用于部署后端和前端应用的 Helm values 文件及 Kubernetes 清单。</p>\n<h2>目录结构</h2>\n<pre><code>devops/\n├── backend.values.yaml    # 后端应用配置（蓝绿部署）\n├── frontend.values.yaml   # 前端应用配置（金丝雀部署）\n├── ingress.yaml          # Ingress 配置\n└── kustomization.yaml    # Kustomize 配置\n</code></pre>\n<h2>应用</h2>\n<h3>后端（蓝绿部署）</h3>\n<p>后端 API 使用蓝绿部署策略，以实现零停机部署和即时回滚能力。</p>\n<p><strong>配置：</strong> <code>backend.values.yaml</code></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>镜像：</strong> <code>156041424727.dkr.ecr.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/backend:v1.0.0</code></li>\n<li><strong>端口：</strong> 8080</li>\n<li><strong>副本数：</strong> 2</li>\n<li><strong>策略：</strong> 蓝绿部署</li>\n<li><strong>健康检查：</strong> <code>/health</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>部署命令：</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 部署后端\nhelm upgrade --install backend ../../charts/app \\\n  -f backend.values.yaml \\\n  -n default\n\n# 提升蓝绿部署\nkubectl argo rollouts promote backend -n default\n\n# 中止发布\nkubectl argo rollouts abort backend -n default\n\n# 检查状态\nkubectl argo rollouts status backend -n default\n</code></pre>\n<h3>前端（金丝雀部署）</h3>\n<p>前端使用金丝雀部署策略，以实现渐进式流量切换和风险缓解。</p>\n<p><strong>配置：</strong> <code>frontend.values.yaml</code></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>镜像：</strong> <code>156041424727.dkr.ecr.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/frontend:v1.0.0</code></li>\n<li><strong>端口：</strong> 80</li>\n<li><strong>副本数：</strong> 2</li>\n<li><strong>策略：</strong> 金丝雀部署（20% → 40% → 60% → 80% → 100%）</li>\n<li><strong>健康检查：</strong> <code>/</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>部署命令：</strong></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 部署前端\nhelm upgrade --install frontend ../../charts/app \\\n  -f frontend.values.yaml \\\n  -n default\n\n# 监控金丝雀发布进度\nkubectl argo rollouts get rollout frontend -n default --watch\n\n# 提升至下一步\nkubectl argo rollouts promote frontend -n default\n\n# 检查状态\nkubectl argo rollouts status frontend -n default\n</code></pre>\n<h2>部署策略</h2>\n<h3>蓝绿部署（后端）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>零停机：</strong> 新版本与旧版本同时运行</li>\n<li><strong>即时回滚：</strong> 立即切换回旧版本</li>\n<li><strong>手动提升：</strong> 需要显式执行提升命令</li>\n<li><strong>预览服务：</strong> 在提升前测试新版本</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>金丝雀部署（前端）</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>渐进式发布：</strong> 流量逐步切换（20% → 40% → 60% → 80%）</li>\n<li><strong>风险缓解：</strong> 问题仅影响部分用户</li>\n<li><strong>自动推进：</strong> 暂停 30 秒后自动进入下一步</li>\n<li><strong>易于中止：</strong> 可在任意步骤回滚</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>更新应用</h2>\n<h3>更新后端</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 更新 backend.values.yaml 中的镜像标签\nimage:\n  tag: v1.1.0\n\n# 应用变更\nhelm upgrade backend ../../charts/app -f backend.values.yaml -n default\n\n# 验证后提升\nkubectl argo rollouts promote backend -n default\n</code></pre>\n<h3>更新前端</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 更新 frontend.values.yaml 中的镜像标签\nimage:\n  tag: v1.1.0\n\n# 应用变更\nhelm upgrade frontend ../../charts/app -f frontend.values.yaml -n default\n\n# 监控金丝雀自动推进\nkubectl argo rollouts get rollout frontend -n default --watch\n</code></pre>\n<h2>监控</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 列出所有发布\nkubectl argo rollouts list -n default\n\n# 获取发布详细信息\nkubectl argo rollouts get rollout &lt;name&gt; -n default\n\n# 监控发布进度\nkubectl argo rollouts get rollout &lt;name&gt; -n default --watch\n\n# 查看发布历史\nkubectl argo rollouts history &lt;name&gt; -n default\n\n# 回滚到上一版本\nkubectl argo rollouts undo &lt;name&gt; -n default\n</code></pre>\n<h2>故障排查</h2>\n<h3>发布卡住</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 检查发布状态\nkubectl argo rollouts status &lt;name&gt; -n default\n\n# 描述发布\nkubectl describe rollout &lt;name&gt; -n default\n\n# 检查 Pod\nkubectl get pods -l app.kubernetes.io/name=&lt;name&gt; -n default\n\n# 查看日志\nkubectl logs -l app.kubernetes.io/name=&lt;name&gt; -n default\n</code></pre>\n<h3>中止并重启</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 中止当前发布\nkubectl argo rollouts abort &lt;name&gt; -n default\n\n# 重启发布\nkubectl argo rollouts restart &lt;name&gt; -n default\n</code></pre>\n<h2>ArgoCD 集成</h2>\n<p>这些应用设计为通过 ArgoCD 使用 app-of-apps 模式进行部署。参见 <code>../../argocd/apps/</code> 目录以获取 ArgoCD Application 清单。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 应用 ArgoCD 应用\nkubectl apply -k ../../argocd/apps/\n</code></pre>","github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_argocd_README_md":"<h1>ArgoCD 设置</h1>\n<h2>手动安装</h2>\n<h3>步骤 1：安装 Argo Rollouts</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">kubectl apply -k cluster/setup/argo-rollouts/\n</code></pre>\n<h3>步骤 2：安装 ArgoCD 基础</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">kubectl apply -k argocd/base/\n</code></pre>\n<p>等待 ArgoCD 就绪：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">kubectl wait --for=condition=available --timeout=300s \\\n  deployment/argocd-server -n argocd\n</code></pre>\n<h3>步骤 3：部署应用</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">kubectl apply -k argocd/applications/\n</code></pre>\n<h2>目录结构</h2>\n<pre><code>argocd/\n├── base/                          # 步骤 1：ArgoCD 基础安装\n│   ├── kustomization.yaml        # 基础资源和补丁\n│   ├── namespace.yaml            # argocd namespace\n│   └── patch/                    # Kustomize 补丁\n│       ├── s3-helm-repo-secret.yaml\n│       └── repo-server-irsa-sa.yaml\n└── applications/                  # 步骤 2：应用部署\n    ├── kustomization.yaml        # App-of-Apps + GitHub secret\n    ├── root.yaml                 # App-of-Apps\n    ├── backend.yaml              # 后端应用\n    ├── frontend.yaml             # 前端应用\n    ├── devops.yaml               # DevOps（ingress）\n    └── secrets/                  # Git 忽略的 secrets\n        ├── github-app.pem\n        └── github-app-config\n</code></pre>\n<h2>访问 ArgoCD</h2>\n<p>获取 admin 密码：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">kubectl -n argocd get secret argocd-initial-admin-secret \\\n  -o jsonpath='{.data.password}' | base64 -d\n</code></pre>\n<p>端口转发：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">kubectl port-forward svc/argocd-server -n argocd 8080:443\n</code></pre>\n<p>访问：https://localhost:8080\n- 用户名：<code>admin</code>\n- 密码：（来自上面的命令）</p>\n<h2>前置条件</h2>\n<h3>1. S3 Helm 仓库</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>包含 Helm chart 的 S3 bucket</li>\n<li>用于 ArgoCD repo-server 的 IRSA role</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>2. GitHub App（私有仓库访问）</h3>\n<h4>创建 GitHub App</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>GitHub Settings → Developer settings → GitHub Apps → New GitHub App</li>\n<li>配置：</li>\n<li><strong>App name</strong>：<code>argocd-repo-access</code></li>\n<li><strong>Homepage URL</strong>：你的 ArgoCD URL（可以是内部地址，例如 argocd.internal）</li>\n<li><strong>Webhook</strong>：禁用</li>\n<li><strong>Repository permissions</strong>：</li>\n<li>Contents：只读</li>\n<li>Metadata：只读</li>\n<li>创建并生成 private key（下载 <code>.pem</code> 文件）</li>\n<li>记录 <strong>App ID</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h4>安装 GitHub App</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Install App → Select repositories</li>\n<li>从 URL 记录 <strong>Installation ID</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h4>配置 Secrets</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>复制配置模板：\n   <code>bash\n   cp argocd/applications/secrets/github-app-config.example \\\n      argocd/applications/secrets/github-app-config</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>编辑 <code>argocd/applications/secrets/github-app-config</code>：\n   <code>bash\n   type=git\n   url=https://github.com/YOUR-ORG/YOUR-REPO\n   githubAppID=YOUR_APP_ID\n   githubAppInstallationID=YOUR_INSTALLATION_ID</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>放置 GitHub App private key：\n   <code>bash\n   cp /path/to/downloaded-key.pem argocd/applications/secrets/github-app.pem</code></p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>验证</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 检查 ArgoCD pods\nkubectl get pods -n argocd\n\n# 检查仓库连接\nkubectl get secret -n argocd github-app-repo\n\n# 检查 applications\nkubectl get applications -n argocd\n</code></pre>\n<h2>故障排查</h2>\n<h3>未找到 CRD</h3>\n<p>如果看到 “no matches for kind Application”：\n- 等待 CRD 注册完成（可能需要 30-60 秒）\n- 检查 CRD 状态：<code>kubectl get crd applications.argoproj.io</code></p>\n<h3>S3 Helm 仓库访问</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>验证 <code>base/patch/repo-server-irsa-sa.yaml</code> 中的 IRSA role ARN</li>\n<li>检查 repo-server 日志：<code>kubectl logs -n argocd deployment/argocd-repo-server</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>GitHub App 身份验证</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>验证 <code>applications/secrets/github-app-config</code> 中的 App ID 和 Installation ID</li>\n<li>检查 private key 格式（应以 <code>-----BEGIN RSA PRIVATE KEY-----</code> 开头）</li>\n<li>测试连接：<code>kubectl get secret -n argocd github-app-repo -o yaml</code></li>\n</ul>","github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_README_md":"<h1>ArgoCD S3 Demo 的 Helm Charts</h1>\n<p>将 Helm chart 上传到 S3 并进行管理的脚本。</p>\n<h2>使用方法</h2>\n<h3>1. 初始设置（仅需一次）</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">./setup.sh\n</code></pre>\n<p>安装插件 + 初始化 S3 repository</p>\n<h3>2. 上传 Chart</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">./push.sh\n</code></pre>\n<p>打包 app chart 并上传到 S3</p>\n<h3>3. 设置索引并上传</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">./index.sh\n</code></pre>\n<h2>手动命令</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># 搜索 chart\nhelm search repo demo-helm-repo\n\n# 下载 chart\nhelm pull demo-helm-repo/app --version 0.1.0\n\n# 重新生成索引\nhelm s3 reindex demo-helm-repo\n</code></pre>","github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_app_README_md":"<h1>App Helm Chart</h1>\n<p>一个灵活的 Helm chart，用于在 Kubernetes 上部署应用，并支持可选的 Argo Rollouts 以实现高级部署策略。</p>\n<h2>特性</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 Argo Rollouts 实现高级部署策略</li>\n<li>支持手动推进的蓝绿部署</li>\n<li>支持渐进式流量切换的金丝雀部署</li>\n<li>可配置的健康检查</li>\n<li>支持 Ingress</li>\n<li>资源管理</li>\n<li>环境变量注入</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>安装</h2>\n<h3>直接使用 Helm</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">helm install my-app ./charts/app -f values.yaml\n</code></pre>\n<h3>使用 ArgoCD</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-yaml\">apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Application\nmetadata:\n  name: my-app\nspec:\n  source:\n    repoURL: s3://my-bucket/charts\n    chart: app\n    targetRevision: 0.1.0\n    helm:\n      valueFiles:\n        - values.yaml\n</code></pre>\n<h2>配置</h2>\n<h3>基础配置</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>replicaCount</code></td>\n<td>副本数量</td>\n<td><code>1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>image.repository</code></td>\n<td>容器镜像仓库</td>\n<td><code>nginx</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>image.tag</code></td>\n<td>容器镜像标签</td>\n<td><code>\"\"</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>image.pullPolicy</code></td>\n<td>镜像拉取策略</td>\n<td><code>IfNotPresent</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>containerPort</code></td>\n<td>容器端口</td>\n<td><code>80</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>service.type</code></td>\n<td>Service 类型</td>\n<td><code>ClusterIP</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>service.port</code></td>\n<td>Service 端口</td>\n<td><code>80</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Rollout 配置</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rollout.strategy</code></td>\n<td>部署策略（<code>blueGreen</code> 或 <code>canary</code>）</td>\n<td><code>blueGreen</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4>蓝绿策略</h4>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rollout.blueGreen.autoPromotionEnabled</code></td>\n<td>自动推进新版本</td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rollout.blueGreen.autoPromotionSeconds</code></td>\n<td>自动推进前的秒数</td>\n<td><code>30</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rollout.blueGreen.scaleDownDelaySeconds</code></td>\n<td>缩容旧版本前的延迟</td>\n<td><code>30</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rollout.blueGreen.previewReplicaCount</code></td>\n<td>预览版本的副本数</td>\n<td><code>1</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h4>金丝雀策略</h4>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rollout.canary.maxSurge</code></td>\n<td>发布过程中允许的最大激增</td>\n<td><code>25%</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rollout.canary.maxUnavailable</code></td>\n<td>最大不可用 Pod 数</td>\n<td><code>0</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rollout.canary.steps</code></td>\n<td>金丝雀发布步骤</td>\n<td>参见 values.yaml</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>健康检查</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>livenessProbe.enabled</code></td>\n<td>启用存活探针</td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>livenessProbe.httpGet.path</code></td>\n<td>存活探针路径</td>\n<td><code>/health</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>readinessProbe.enabled</code></td>\n<td>启用就绪探针</td>\n<td><code>true</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>readinessProbe.httpGet.path</code></td>\n<td>就绪探针路径</td>\n<td><code>/health</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>资源</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>默认值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resources.limits.cpu</code></td>\n<td>CPU 上限</td>\n<td><code>500m</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resources.limits.memory</code></td>\n<td>内存上限</td>\n<td><code>512Mi</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resources.requests.cpu</code></td>\n<td>CPU 请求</td>\n<td><code>100m</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>resources.requests.memory</code></td>\n<td>内存请求</td>\n<td><code>128Mi</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>示例</h2>\n<h3>蓝绿部署</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-yaml\">replicaCount: 2\nimage:\n  repository: my-backend\n  tag: v1.0.0\nservice:\n  port: 8080\nrollout:\n  strategy: blueGreen\n  blueGreen:\n    autoPromotionEnabled: false\n    scaleDownDelaySeconds: 30\n</code></pre>\n<h3>金丝雀部署</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-yaml\">replicaCount: 3\nimage:\n  repository: my-frontend\n  tag: v1.0.0\nrollout:\n  strategy: canary\n  canary:\n    steps:\n      - setWeight: 20\n      - pause: {duration: 1m}\n      - setWeight: 50\n      - pause: {duration: 2m}\n      - setWeight: 80\n      - pause: {duration: 1m}\n</code></pre>\n<h2>环境要求</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kubernetes 1.19+</li>\n<li>Helm 3.0+</li>\n<li>Argo Rollouts（如果使用 rollout 功能）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>许可证</h2>\n<p>MIT</p>","github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_app_templates_NOTES_txt":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">===========================================\n  {{ .Chart.Name }} - {{ .Chart.Version }}\n===========================================\n\n部署策略：{{ .Values.rollout.strategy | upper }}\n\n你的应用已使用 Argo Rollouts 完成部署！\n\n{{- if eq .Values.rollout.strategy &quot;blueGreen&quot; }}\n\n蓝绿部署（Blue-Green Deployment）：\n- 活跃服务（Active Service）：{{ .Values.rollout.blueGreen.activeService | default (include &quot;app.fullname&quot; .) }}\n- 预览服务（Preview Service）：{{ .Values.rollout.blueGreen.previewService | default (printf &quot;%s-preview&quot; (include &quot;app.fullname&quot; .)) }}\n- 自动晋级（Auto Promotion）：{{ .Values.rollout.blueGreen.autoPromotionEnabled }}\n\n将预览版本晋级为正式版本：\n  kubectl argo rollouts promote {{ include &quot;app.fullname&quot; . }} -n {{ .Release.Namespace }}\n\n中止发布：\n  kubectl argo rollouts abort {{ include &quot;app.fullname&quot; . }} -n {{ .Release.Namespace }}\n\n{{- else if eq .Values.rollout.strategy &quot;canary&quot; }}\n\n金丝雀部署（Canary Deployment）：\n- 已配置金丝雀步骤，实现流量的逐步迁移\n\n查看发布进度：\n  kubectl argo rollouts get rollout {{ include &quot;app.fullname&quot; . }} -n {{ .Release.Namespace }} --watch\n\n晋级到下一步：\n  kubectl argo rollouts promote {{ include &quot;app.fullname&quot; . }} -n {{ .Release.Namespace }}\n\n{{- end }}\n\n查看发布状态：\n  kubectl argo rollouts status {{ include &quot;app.fullname&quot; . }} -n {{ .Release.Namespace }}\n\n1. 运行以下命令获取应用访问地址：\n{{- if .Values.ingress.enabled }}\n{{- range $host := .Values.ingress.hosts }}\n  {{- range .paths }}\n  http{{ if $.Values.ingress.tls }}s{{ end }}://{{ $host.host }}{{ .path }}\n  {{- end }}\n{{- end }}\n{{- else if contains &quot;NodePort&quot; .Values.service.type }}\n  export NODE_PORT=$(kubectl get --namespace {{ .Release.Namespace }} -o jsonpath=&quot;{.spec.ports[0].nodePort}&quot; services {{ include &quot;app.fullname&quot; . }})\n  export NODE_IP=$(kubectl get nodes --namespace {{ .Release.Namespace }} -o jsonpath=&quot;{.items[0].status.addresses[0].address}&quot;)\n  echo http://$NODE_IP:$NODE_PORT\n{{- else if contains &quot;LoadBalancer&quot; .Values.service.type }}\n     注意：LoadBalancer 的 IP 可能需要几分钟才能就绪。\n           你可以通过运行 &#x27;kubectl get --namespace {{ .Release.Namespace }} svc -w {{ include &quot;app.fullname&quot; . }}&#x27; 来观察其状态。\n  export SERVICE_IP=$(kubectl get svc --namespace {{ .Release.Namespace }} {{ include &quot;app.fullname&quot; . }} --template &quot;{{&quot;{{ range (index .status.loadBalancer.ingress 0) }}{{.}}{{ end }}&quot;}}&quot;)\n  echo http://$SERVICE_IP:{{ .Values.service.port }}\n{{- else if contains &quot;ClusterIP&quot; .Values.service.type }}\n  export POD_NAME=$(kubectl get pods --namespace {{ .Release.Namespace }} -l &quot;app.kubernetes.io/name={{ include &quot;app.name&quot; . }},app.kubernetes.io/instance={{ .Release.Name }}&quot; -o jsonpath=&quot;{.items[0].metadata.name}&quot;)\n  export CONTAINER_PORT=$(kubectl get pod --namespace {{ .Release.Namespace }} $POD_NAME -o jsonpath=&quot;{.spec.containers[0].ports[0].containerPort}&quot;)\n  echo &quot;访问 http://127.0.0.1:8080 以使用你的应用&quot;\n  kubectl --namespace {{ .Release.Namespace }} port-forward $POD_NAME 8080:$CONTAINER_PORT\n{{- end }}</pre>","github-repos-zh_argocd-s3-helm-main_setup_README_md":"<h1>集群设置</h1>\n<p>用于设置 EKS 集群各组件的脚本和配置。</p>\n<h2>组件</h2>\n<h3>AWS Load Balancer Controller</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>用途</strong>：管理 ALB/NLB Ingress 控制器</li>\n<li><strong>位置</strong>：<code>aws-load-balancer-controller/</code></li>\n<li><strong>IRSA</strong>：需要为 Service Account 配置 IAM 角色</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Cert Manager</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>用途</strong>：自动管理 TLS 证书</li>\n<li><strong>位置</strong>：<code>cert-manager/</code></li>\n<li><strong>特性</strong>：集成 Let's Encrypt</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Argo Rollouts</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>用途</strong>：高级部署策略</li>\n<li><strong>位置</strong>：<code>argo-rollouts/</code></li>\n<li><strong>策略</strong>：蓝绿部署、金丝雀部署</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>设置流程</h2>\n<h3>1. 应用所有组件</h3>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\">export CLUSTER_NAME=your-cluster-name\nexport AWS_REGION=ap-northeast-2\n./apply.sh\n</code></pre>\n<p>该脚本会自动：\n- 查找你的 EKS 集群对应的 VPC\n- 为公有子网打上标签 <code>kubernetes.io/role/elb=1</code>\n- 为私有子网打上标签 <code>kubernetes.io/role/internal-elb=1</code></p>\n<h2>前置条件</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>EKS 集群正在运行</li>\n<li>已配置 kubectl</li>\n<li>已配置 AWS CLI</li>\n<li>具备相应的 IAM 权限</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>验证</h2>\n<p>检查组件状态：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-bash\"># AWS Load Balancer Controller\nkubectl get deployment -n kube-system aws-load-balancer-controller\n\n# Cert Manager\nkubectl get pods -n cert-manager\n\n# Argo Rollouts\nkubectl get pods -n argo-rollouts\n</code></pre>\n<h2>故障排查</h2>\n<h3>ALB Controller 问题</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>确认 IRSA 角色存在且具有正确的权限</li>\n<li>检查子网标签以确保自动发现功能正常</li>\n<li>查看控制器日志：<code>kubectl logs -n kube-system deployment/aws-load-balancer-controller</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Cert Manager 问题</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>检查 CRD 是否已安装：<code>kubectl get crd | grep cert-manager</code></li>\n<li>确认 webhook 正在运行：<code>kubectl get pods -n cert-manager</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Argo Rollouts 问题</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>确保 CRD 已安装：<code>kubectl get crd | grep rollouts</code></li>\n<li>查看控制器日志：<code>kubectl logs -n argo-rollouts deployment/argo-rollouts</code></li>\n</ul>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra__terraform_lock_hcl":"<pre class=\"rawtext\"># This file is maintained automatically by &quot;terraform init&quot;.\n# Manual edits may be lost in future updates.\n\nprovider &quot;registry.terraform.io/hashicorp/aws&quot; {\n  version     = &quot;6.30.0&quot;\n  constraints = &quot;&gt;= 5.0.0&quot;\n  hashes = [\n    &quot;h1:FNkicntiPhllPhKf8uBJTCQVY/cqN/sXa/LwE4Q0ML8=&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:08fdcbb84b63739b758fd2f657303f495859ae15f2d6c3dbd642520cadb5f063&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:1e69ff49906541cd511bdabcd4b2996a731b1642ba26b834cdac5432e8d5c557&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:3aa23e3af1fb1dd0c025cb8fb73abdabd3f44b6a687a2a239947e7b0201b2f1f&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:4b3b81e63eee913c874e8115d6a83d12bd9d7903446f91be15ba50c583c79549&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:6e93a72d8770d73a4122dc82af33a020d58feeaca4e194a2685dce30dbcdce24&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:74be722c9a64b95e06554cde0bef624084cc5a5ea7f3373f1975b7a4737d7074&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:7d2acf6bc93be26504fd0e2965c77699a49549f74a767d0a81430d9e12d51358&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:9b12af85486a96aedd8d7984b0ff811a4b42e3d88dad1a3fb4c0b580d04fa425&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:aef629bc537b4cc0f64ece87bc2bfdb3e032a4d03a3f7f301f4c84ffdc2ac1ac&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:b41dcc4a2c8e356d82d3f92629aab0e25849db106a43e7adf06d8c6bda7af4c9&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:b4d7a9cf9ad5ac5dd07f4ea1e834b63f14e752f9aca9452cd99570fed16e0c12&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:bcb20f64b9b4599fa746305bcff7eeee3da85029dc467f812f950cf45b519436&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:e45a520b82a1d2d42360db1b93d8e96406a7548948ed528bac5018e1d731c5c6&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:f743e4a0e10dc64669469e6a22e47012f07fb94587f5a1e8cf5431da4e878ae1&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:fe1895af7dcc5815896f892b2593fe71b7f4f364b71d9487d6e8b10ef244c11c&quot;,\n  ]\n}\n\nprovider &quot;registry.terraform.io/hashicorp/tls&quot; {\n  version     = &quot;4.2.1&quot;\n  constraints = &quot;&gt;= 4.0.0&quot;\n  hashes = [\n    &quot;h1:akFNuHwvrtnYMBofieoeXhPJDhYZzJVu/Q/BgZK2fgg=&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:0d1e7d07ac973b97fa228f46596c800de830820506ee145626f079dd6bbf8d8a&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:5c7e3d4348cb4861ab812973ef493814a4b224bdd3e9d534a7c8a7c992382b86&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:7c6d4a86cd7a4e9c1025c6b3a3a6a45dea202af85d870cddbab455fb1bd568ad&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:7d0864755ba093664c4b2c07c045d3f5e3d7c799dda1a3ef33d17ed1ac563191&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:83734f57950ab67c0d6a87babdb3f13c908cbe0a48949333f489698532e1391b&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:951e3c285218ebca0cf20eaa4265020b4ef042fea9c6ade115ad1558cfe459e5&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:b9543955b4297e1d93b85900854891c0e645d936d8285a190030475379c5c635&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:bb1bd9e86c003d08c30c1b00d44118ed5bbbf6b1d2d6f7eaac4fa5c6ebea5933&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:c9477bfe00653629cd77ddac3968475f7ad93ac3ca8bc45b56d1d9efb25e4a6e&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:d4cfda8687f736d0cba664c22ec49dae1188289e214ef57f5afe6a7217854fed&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:dc77ee066cf96532a48f0578c35b1eaf6dc4d8ddd0e3ae8e029a3b10676dd5d3&quot;,\n    &quot;zh:f569b65999264a9416862bca5cd2a6177d94ccb0424f3a4ef424428912b9cb3c&quot;,\n  ]\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_main_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">data &quot;aws_caller_identity&quot; &quot;current&quot; {}\n\nresource &quot;aws_s3_bucket&quot; &quot;helm_chart_bucket&quot; {\n  bucket = &quot;argo-chart-${data.aws_caller_identity.current.account_id}&quot;\n\n  tags = {\n    Name = &quot;argo-chart-${data.aws_caller_identity.current.account_id}&quot;\n  }\n}\n\nmodule &quot;networking&quot; {\n  source = &quot;./modules/networking&quot;\n\n  region            = var.region\n  vpc_cidr          = var.vpc_cidr\n  azs               = var.azs\n  subnet_count      = var.subnet_count\n  nat_gw_per_subnet = var.nat_gw_per_subnet\n  cluster_name      = var.cluster_name\n}\n\nmodule &quot;container&quot; {\n  source = &quot;./modules/container&quot;\n\n  region              = var.region\n  cluster_name        = var.cluster_name\n  eks_version         = var.eks_version\n  vpc_id              = module.networking.vpc_id\n  private_subnet_ids  = module.networking.private_subnet_ids\n  public_access_cidrs = var.public_access_cidrs\n\n  node_instance_type = var.node_instance_type\n  node_desired_size  = var.node_desired_size\n  node_min_size      = var.node_min_size\n  node_max_size      = var.node_max_size\n}\n\nmodule &quot;iam&quot; {\n  source = &quot;./modules/iam&quot;\n\n  oidc_provider_arn = module.container.oidc_provider_arn\n  oidc_provider_url = module.container.oidc_provider_url\n\n  argo_namespace   = var.argo_namespace\n  argo_sa_name     = var.argo_sa_name\n  argo_role_name   = var.argo_role_name\n  argo_policy_name = var.argo_policy_name\n  s3_bucket_arn    = aws_s3_bucket.helm_chart_bucket.arn\n\n  alb_namespace   = var.alb_namespace\n  alb_sa_name     = var.alb_sa_name\n  alb_role_name   = var.alb_role_name\n  alb_policy_name = var.alb_policy_name\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_container_ecr_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">locals {\n  ecr_repositories = [&quot;backend&quot;, &quot;frontend&quot;]\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_ecr_repository&quot; &quot;app&quot; {\n  for_each = toset(local.ecr_repositories)\n\n  name                 = &quot;${var.ecr_repository_prefix}-${each.key}&quot;\n  image_tag_mutability = &quot;MUTABLE&quot;\n\n  image_scanning_configuration {\n    scan_on_push = true\n  }\n\n  encryption_configuration {\n    encryption_type = &quot;AES256&quot;\n  }\n\n  tags = {\n    Name        = &quot;${var.ecr_repository_prefix}-${each.key}&quot;\n    Environment = &quot;production&quot;\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_ecr_lifecycle_policy&quot; &quot;app&quot; {\n  for_each = toset(local.ecr_repositories)\n\n  repository = aws_ecr_repository.app[each.key].name\n\n  policy = jsonencode({\n    rules = [\n      {\n        rulePriority = 1\n        description  = &quot;Keep last 30 images&quot;\n        selection = {\n          tagStatus   = &quot;any&quot;\n          countType   = &quot;imageCountMoreThan&quot;\n          countNumber = 30\n        }\n        action = {\n          type = &quot;expire&quot;\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  })\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_container_eks_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">\ndata &quot;aws_iam_policy_document&quot; &quot;eks_cluster_assume_role&quot; {\n  statement {\n    actions = [&quot;sts:AssumeRole&quot;]\n\n    principals {\n      type        = &quot;Service&quot;\n      identifiers = [&quot;eks.amazonaws.com&quot;]\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role&quot; &quot;cluster&quot; {\n  name               = &quot;${var.cluster_name}-cluster-role&quot;\n  assume_role_policy = data.aws_iam_policy_document.eks_cluster_assume_role.json\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;cluster_policy&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.cluster.name\n  policy_arn = &quot;arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AmazonEKSClusterPolicy&quot;\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;cluster_vpc_controller&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.cluster.name\n  policy_arn = &quot;arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AmazonEKSVPCResourceController&quot;\n}\n\ndata &quot;aws_iam_policy_document&quot; &quot;node_assume_role&quot; {\n  statement {\n    actions = [&quot;sts:AssumeRole&quot;]\n\n    principals {\n      type        = &quot;Service&quot;\n      identifiers = [&quot;ec2.amazonaws.com&quot;]\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role&quot; &quot;node&quot; {\n  name               = &quot;${var.cluster_name}-node-role&quot;\n  assume_role_policy = data.aws_iam_policy_document.node_assume_role.json\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;node_worker&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.node.name\n  policy_arn = &quot;arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AmazonEKSWorkerNodePolicy&quot;\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;node_cni&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.node.name\n  policy_arn = &quot;arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AmazonEKS_CNI_Policy&quot;\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;node_ecr&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.node.name\n  policy_arn = &quot;arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AmazonEC2ContainerRegistryReadOnly&quot;\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;node_ebs_csi&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.node.name\n  policy_arn = &quot;arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/service-role/AmazonEBSCSIDriverPolicy&quot;\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;node_cloudwatch&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.node.name\n  policy_arn = &quot;arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy&quot;\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;node_xray&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.node.name\n  policy_arn = &quot;arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AWSXRayDaemonWriteAccess&quot;\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_security_group&quot; &quot;eks_cluster_sg&quot; {\n  name_prefix = &quot;${var.cluster_name}-cluster-sg&quot;\n  vpc_id      = var.vpc_id\n\n  tags = {\n    Name = &quot;${var.cluster_name}-cluster-sg&quot;\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_security_group_rule&quot; &quot;eks_cluster_ingress_allow_443&quot; {\n  security_group_id = aws_security_group.eks_cluster_sg.id\n  type              = &quot;ingress&quot;\n  protocol          = &quot;tcp&quot;\n  from_port         = 443\n  to_port           = 443\n  cidr_blocks       = [&quot;0.0.0.0/0&quot;]\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_security_group_rule&quot; &quot;eks_cluster_egress_all&quot; {\n  security_group_id = aws_security_group.eks_cluster_sg.id\n  type              = &quot;egress&quot;\n  protocol          = &quot;-1&quot;\n  from_port         = 0\n  to_port           = 0\n  cidr_blocks       = [&quot;0.0.0.0/0&quot;]\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_eks_cluster&quot; &quot;this&quot; {\n  name     = var.cluster_name\n  role_arn = aws_iam_role.cluster.arn\n  version  = var.eks_version\n\n  vpc_config {\n    subnet_ids              = var.private_subnet_ids\n    endpoint_private_access = true\n    endpoint_public_access  = true\n    public_access_cidrs     = var.public_access_cidrs\n    security_group_ids      = [aws_security_group.eks_cluster_sg.id]\n  }\n\n  enabled_cluster_log_types = [&quot;api&quot;, &quot;audit&quot;, &quot;authenticator&quot;, &quot;controllerManager&quot;, &quot;scheduler&quot;]\n\n  depends_on = [\n    aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.cluster_policy,\n    aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.cluster_vpc_controller\n  ]\n\n  tags = {\n    Environment = &quot;production&quot;\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_launch_template&quot; &quot;node&quot; {\n  name_prefix = &quot;${var.cluster_name}-node-&quot;\n\n  metadata_options {\n    http_endpoint               = &quot;enabled&quot;\n    http_tokens                 = &quot;required&quot;\n    http_put_response_hop_limit = 5\n  }\n\n  tag_specifications {\n    resource_type = &quot;instance&quot;\n    tags = {\n      Name        = &quot;${var.cluster_name}-node&quot;\n      Environment = &quot;production&quot;\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_eks_node_group&quot; &quot;default&quot; {\n  cluster_name    = aws_eks_cluster.this.name\n  node_group_name = &quot;${var.cluster_name}-ng&quot;\n  node_role_arn   = aws_iam_role.node.arn\n  subnet_ids      = var.private_subnet_ids\n  instance_types  = [var.node_instance_type]\n  ami_type        = &quot;AL2023_x86_64_STANDARD&quot;\n\n  launch_template {\n    id      = aws_launch_template.node.id\n    version = aws_launch_template.node.latest_version\n  }\n\n  scaling_config {\n    desired_size = var.node_desired_size\n    min_size     = var.node_min_size\n    max_size     = var.node_max_size\n  }\n\n  update_config {\n    max_unavailable = 1\n  }\n\n  labels = {\n    role      = &quot;worker&quot;\n    node-type = &quot;general&quot;\n  }\n\n  tags = {\n    &quot;nodegroup-role&quot; = &quot;worker&quot;\n    Environment      = &quot;production&quot;\n  }\n\n  depends_on = [\n    aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_worker,\n    aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_cni,\n    aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_ecr,\n    aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_ebs_csi,\n    aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_cloudwatch,\n    aws_iam_role_policy_attachment.node_xray\n  ]\n}\n\n# Fargate Profile\nresource &quot;aws_eks_fargate_profile&quot; &quot;app&quot; {\n  cluster_name           = aws_eks_cluster.this.name\n  fargate_profile_name   = &quot;${var.cluster_name}-fargate-profile&quot;\n  pod_execution_role_arn = aws_iam_role.fargate.arn\n  subnet_ids             = var.private_subnet_ids\n\n  selector {\n    namespace = &quot;app&quot;\n    labels = {\n      &quot;run-on&quot; = &quot;fargate&quot;\n    }\n  }\n\n  tags = {\n    &quot;profile-type&quot; = &quot;fargate&quot;\n    Environment    = &quot;production&quot;\n  }\n}\n\ndata &quot;aws_iam_policy_document&quot; &quot;fargate_assume_role&quot; {\n  statement {\n    actions = [&quot;sts:AssumeRole&quot;]\n\n    principals {\n      type        = &quot;Service&quot;\n      identifiers = [&quot;eks-fargate-pods.amazonaws.com&quot;]\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role&quot; &quot;fargate&quot; {\n  name               = &quot;${var.cluster_name}-fargate-role&quot;\n  assume_role_policy = data.aws_iam_policy_document.fargate_assume_role.json\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;fargate_pod_execution&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.fargate.name\n  policy_arn = &quot;arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AmazonEKSFargatePodExecutionRolePolicy&quot;\n}\n\n# OIDC Provider\ndata &quot;tls_certificate&quot; &quot;oidc&quot; {\n  url = aws_eks_cluster.this.identity[0].oidc[0].issuer\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_openid_connect_provider&quot; &quot;this&quot; {\n  url = aws_eks_cluster.this.identity[0].oidc[0].issuer\n\n  client_id_list  = [&quot;sts.amazonaws.com&quot;]\n  thumbprint_list = [data.tls_certificate.oidc.certificates[0].sha1_fingerprint]\n}\n\n# ============================================================\n# EKS Addons\n# ============================================================\n\n# VPC CNI Addon\nresource &quot;aws_eks_addon&quot; &quot;vpc_cni&quot; {\n  cluster_name = aws_eks_cluster.this.name\n  addon_name   = &quot;vpc-cni&quot;\n\n  configuration_values = jsonencode({\n    env = {\n      ENABLE_PREFIX_DELEGATION = &quot;true&quot;\n      WARM_PREFIX_TARGET       = &quot;1&quot;\n    }\n  })\n\n  resolve_conflicts_on_create = &quot;OVERWRITE&quot;\n  resolve_conflicts_on_update = &quot;OVERWRITE&quot;\n\n  depends_on = [aws_eks_node_group.default]\n}\n\n# CoreDNS Addon\nresource &quot;aws_eks_addon&quot; &quot;coredns&quot; {\n  cluster_name = aws_eks_cluster.this.name\n  addon_name   = &quot;coredns&quot;\n\n  resolve_conflicts_on_create = &quot;OVERWRITE&quot;\n  resolve_conflicts_on_update = &quot;OVERWRITE&quot;\n\n  depends_on = [aws_eks_node_group.default]\n}\n\n# kube-proxy Addon\nresource &quot;aws_eks_addon&quot; &quot;kube_proxy&quot; {\n  cluster_name = aws_eks_cluster.this.name\n  addon_name   = &quot;kube-proxy&quot;\n\n  resolve_conflicts_on_create = &quot;OVERWRITE&quot;\n  resolve_conflicts_on_update = &quot;OVERWRITE&quot;\n\n  depends_on = [aws_eks_node_group.default]\n}\n\n# EBS CSI Driver Addon\nresource &quot;aws_eks_addon&quot; &quot;ebs_csi_driver&quot; {\n  cluster_name             = aws_eks_cluster.this.name\n  addon_name               = &quot;aws-ebs-csi-driver&quot;\n  service_account_role_arn = aws_iam_role.ebs_csi.arn\n\n  resolve_conflicts_on_create = &quot;OVERWRITE&quot;\n  resolve_conflicts_on_update = &quot;OVERWRITE&quot;\n\n  depends_on = [aws_eks_node_group.default]\n}\n\n# EBS CSI Driver IAM Role\ndata &quot;aws_iam_policy_document&quot; &quot;ebs_csi_assume_role&quot; {\n  statement {\n    actions = [&quot;sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity&quot;]\n\n    principals {\n      type        = &quot;Federated&quot;\n      identifiers = [aws_iam_openid_connect_provider.this.arn]\n    }\n\n    condition {\n      test     = &quot;StringEquals&quot;\n      variable = &quot;${replace(aws_iam_openid_connect_provider.this.url, &quot;https://&quot;, &quot;&quot;)}:sub&quot;\n      values   = [&quot;system:serviceaccount:kube-system:ebs-csi-controller-sa&quot;]\n    }\n\n    condition {\n      test     = &quot;StringEquals&quot;\n      variable = &quot;${replace(aws_iam_openid_connect_provider.this.url, &quot;https://&quot;, &quot;&quot;)}:aud&quot;\n      values   = [&quot;sts.amazonaws.com&quot;]\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role&quot; &quot;ebs_csi&quot; {\n  name               = &quot;${var.cluster_name}-ebs-csi-role&quot;\n  assume_role_policy = data.aws_iam_policy_document.ebs_csi_assume_role.json\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;ebs_csi&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.ebs_csi.name\n  policy_arn = &quot;arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/service-role/AmazonEBSCSIDriverPolicy&quot;\n}\n\n# EKS Pod Identity Agent Addon\nresource &quot;aws_eks_addon&quot; &quot;pod_identity_agent&quot; {\n  cluster_name = aws_eks_cluster.this.name\n  addon_name   = &quot;eks-pod-identity-agent&quot;\n\n  resolve_conflicts_on_create = &quot;OVERWRITE&quot;\n  resolve_conflicts_on_update = &quot;OVERWRITE&quot;\n\n  depends_on = [aws_eks_node_group.default]\n}\n\n# CloudWatch Observability Addon\nresource &quot;aws_eks_addon&quot; &quot;cloudwatch_observability&quot; {\n  cluster_name             = aws_eks_cluster.this.name\n  addon_name               = &quot;amazon-cloudwatch-observability&quot;\n  service_account_role_arn = aws_iam_role.cloudwatch_agent.arn\n\n  configuration_values = jsonencode({\n    agent = {\n      config = {\n        logs = {\n          metrics_collected = {\n            kubernetes = {\n              enhanced_container_insights = true\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    containerLogs = {\n      enabled = true\n    }\n  })\n\n  resolve_conflicts_on_create = &quot;OVERWRITE&quot;\n  resolve_conflicts_on_update = &quot;OVERWRITE&quot;\n\n  depends_on = [aws_eks_node_group.default]\n}\n\n# CloudWatch Agent IAM Role\ndata &quot;aws_iam_policy_document&quot; &quot;cloudwatch_agent_assume_role&quot; {\n  statement {\n    actions = [&quot;sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity&quot;]\n\n    principals {\n      type        = &quot;Federated&quot;\n      identifiers = [aws_iam_openid_connect_provider.this.arn]\n    }\n\n    condition {\n      test     = &quot;StringEquals&quot;\n      variable = &quot;${replace(aws_iam_openid_connect_provider.this.url, &quot;https://&quot;, &quot;&quot;)}:sub&quot;\n      values   = [&quot;system:serviceaccount:amazon-cloudwatch:cloudwatch-agent&quot;]\n    }\n\n    condition {\n      test     = &quot;StringEquals&quot;\n      variable = &quot;${replace(aws_iam_openid_connect_provider.this.url, &quot;https://&quot;, &quot;&quot;)}:aud&quot;\n      values   = [&quot;sts.amazonaws.com&quot;]\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role&quot; &quot;cloudwatch_agent&quot; {\n  name               = &quot;${var.cluster_name}-cloudwatch-agent-role&quot;\n  assume_role_policy = data.aws_iam_policy_document.cloudwatch_agent_assume_role.json\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;cloudwatch_agent&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.cloudwatch_agent.name\n  policy_arn = &quot;arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/CloudWatchAgentServerPolicy&quot;\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;cloudwatch_agent_xray&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.cloudwatch_agent.name\n  policy_arn = &quot;arn:aws:iam::aws:policy/AWSXRayDaemonWriteAccess&quot;\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_container_outputs_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">output &quot;cluster_name&quot; {\n  value = aws_eks_cluster.this.name\n}\n\noutput &quot;cluster_arn&quot; {\n  value = aws_eks_cluster.this.arn\n}\n\noutput &quot;cluster_endpoint&quot; {\n  value = aws_eks_cluster.this.endpoint\n}\n\noutput &quot;cluster_security_group_id&quot; {\n  value = aws_eks_cluster.this.vpc_config[0].cluster_security_group_id\n}\n\noutput &quot;node_role_arn&quot; {\n  value = aws_iam_role.node.arn\n}\n\noutput &quot;node_group_name&quot; {\n  value = aws_eks_node_group.default.node_group_name\n}\n\noutput &quot;oidc_provider_arn&quot; {\n  value = aws_iam_openid_connect_provider.this.arn\n}\n\noutput &quot;oidc_provider_url&quot; {\n  value = aws_eks_cluster.this.identity[0].oidc[0].issuer\n}\n\noutput &quot;eks_cluster_certificate_authority&quot; {\n  value = aws_eks_cluster.this.certificate_authority[0].data\n}\n\noutput &quot;ecr_backend_repository_url&quot; {\n  value = aws_ecr_repository.app[&quot;backend&quot;].repository_url\n}\n\noutput &quot;ecr_frontend_repository_url&quot; {\n  value = aws_ecr_repository.app[&quot;frontend&quot;].repository_url\n}</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_container_variable_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">variable &quot;region&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;cluster_name&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;eks_version&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;vpc_id&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;private_subnet_ids&quot; {\n  type = list(string)\n}\n\nvariable &quot;public_access_cidrs&quot; {\n  type = list(string)\n}\n\nvariable &quot;node_instance_type&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;node_desired_size&quot; {\n  type = number\n}\n\nvariable &quot;node_min_size&quot; {\n  type = number\n}\n\nvariable &quot;node_max_size&quot; {\n  type = number\n}\n\nvariable &quot;ecr_repository_prefix&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;argo&quot;\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_iam_iam_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">\nlocals {\n  oidc_provider         = replace(var.oidc_provider_url, &quot;https://&quot;, &quot;&quot;)\n  trust_policy_template = file(&quot;${path.module}/policies/trust_policy_template.json&quot;)\n\n  argo_trust_policy = replace(\n    replace(\n      replace(\n        replace(local.trust_policy_template, &quot;__OIDC_PROVIDER_ARN__&quot;, var.oidc_provider_arn),\n        &quot;__OIDC_PROVIDER__&quot;,\n        local.oidc_provider\n      ),\n      &quot;__NAMESPACE__&quot;,\n      var.argo_namespace\n    ),\n    &quot;__SERVICE_ACCOUNT__&quot;,\n    var.argo_sa_name\n  )\n\n  alb_trust_policy = replace(\n    replace(\n      replace(\n        replace(local.trust_policy_template, &quot;__OIDC_PROVIDER_ARN__&quot;, var.oidc_provider_arn),\n        &quot;__OIDC_PROVIDER__&quot;,\n        local.oidc_provider\n      ),\n      &quot;__NAMESPACE__&quot;,\n      var.alb_namespace\n    ),\n    &quot;__SERVICE_ACCOUNT__&quot;,\n    var.alb_sa_name\n  )\n}\n\ndata &quot;aws_iam_policy_document&quot; &quot;argo_repo&quot; {\n  statement {\n    effect = &quot;Allow&quot;\n    actions = [\n      &quot;s3:GetBucketLocation&quot;,\n      &quot;s3:ListBucket&quot;\n    ]\n    resources = [var.s3_bucket_arn]\n  }\n\n  statement {\n    effect    = &quot;Allow&quot;\n    actions   = [&quot;s3:GetObject&quot;]\n    resources = [&quot;${var.s3_bucket_arn}/*&quot;]\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_policy&quot; &quot;argo_repo&quot; {\n  name   = var.argo_policy_name\n  policy = data.aws_iam_policy_document.argo_repo.json\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role&quot; &quot;argo_repo&quot; {\n  name               = var.argo_role_name\n  assume_role_policy = local.argo_trust_policy\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;argo_repo&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.argo_repo.name\n  policy_arn = aws_iam_policy.argo_repo.arn\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_policy&quot; &quot;alb_controller&quot; {\n  name   = var.alb_policy_name\n  policy = file(&quot;${path.module}/policies/alb_ingress_role.json&quot;)\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role&quot; &quot;alb_controller&quot; {\n  name               = var.alb_role_name\n  assume_role_policy = local.alb_trust_policy\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_iam_role_policy_attachment&quot; &quot;alb_controller&quot; {\n  role       = aws_iam_role.alb_controller.name\n  policy_arn = aws_iam_policy.alb_controller.arn\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_iam_outputs_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">output &quot;argocd_repo_role_arn&quot; {\n  value = aws_iam_role.argo_repo.arn\n}\n\noutput &quot;alb_controller_role_arn&quot; {\n  value = aws_iam_role.alb_controller.arn\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_iam_policies_alb_ingress_role_json":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">{\n  &quot;Version&quot;: &quot;2012-10-17&quot;,\n  &quot;Statement&quot;: [\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;iam:CreateServiceLinkedRole&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;*&quot;,\n      &quot;Condition&quot;: {\n        &quot;StringEquals&quot;: {\n          &quot;iam:AWSServiceName&quot;: &quot;elasticloadbalancing.amazonaws.com&quot;\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeAccountAttributes&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeAddresses&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeAvailabilityZones&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeInternetGateways&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeVpcs&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeVpcPeeringConnections&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeSubnets&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeSecurityGroups&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeInstances&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeNetworkInterfaces&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeTags&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:GetCoipPoolUsage&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeCoipPools&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:GetSecurityGroupsForVpc&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeIpamPools&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DescribeRouteTables&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeLoadBalancers&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeLoadBalancerAttributes&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeListeners&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeListenerCertificates&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeSSLPolicies&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeRules&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeTargetGroups&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeTargetGroupAttributes&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeTargetHealth&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeTags&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeTrustStores&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeListenerAttributes&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DescribeCapacityReservation&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;*&quot;\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;cognito-idp:DescribeUserPoolClient&quot;,\n        &quot;acm:ListCertificates&quot;,\n        &quot;acm:DescribeCertificate&quot;,\n        &quot;iam:ListServerCertificates&quot;,\n        &quot;iam:GetServerCertificate&quot;,\n        &quot;waf-regional:GetWebACL&quot;,\n        &quot;waf-regional:GetWebACLForResource&quot;,\n        &quot;waf-regional:AssociateWebACL&quot;,\n        &quot;waf-regional:DisassociateWebACL&quot;,\n        &quot;wafv2:GetWebACL&quot;,\n        &quot;wafv2:GetWebACLForResource&quot;,\n        &quot;wafv2:AssociateWebACL&quot;,\n        &quot;wafv2:DisassociateWebACL&quot;,\n        &quot;shield:GetSubscriptionState&quot;,\n        &quot;shield:DescribeProtection&quot;,\n        &quot;shield:CreateProtection&quot;,\n        &quot;shield:DeleteProtection&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;*&quot;\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;ec2:AuthorizeSecurityGroupIngress&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:RevokeSecurityGroupIngress&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;*&quot;\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;ec2:CreateSecurityGroup&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;*&quot;\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;ec2:CreateTags&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;arn:aws:ec2:*:*:security-group/*&quot;,\n      &quot;Condition&quot;: {\n        &quot;StringEquals&quot;: {\n          &quot;ec2:CreateAction&quot;: &quot;CreateSecurityGroup&quot;\n        },\n        &quot;Null&quot;: {\n          &quot;aws:RequestTag/elbv2.k8s.aws/cluster&quot;: &quot;false&quot;\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;ec2:CreateTags&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DeleteTags&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;arn:aws:ec2:*:*:security-group/*&quot;,\n      &quot;Condition&quot;: {\n        &quot;Null&quot;: {\n          &quot;aws:RequestTag/elbv2.k8s.aws/cluster&quot;: &quot;true&quot;,\n          &quot;aws:ResourceTag/elbv2.k8s.aws/cluster&quot;: &quot;false&quot;\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;ec2:AuthorizeSecurityGroupIngress&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:RevokeSecurityGroupIngress&quot;,\n        &quot;ec2:DeleteSecurityGroup&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;*&quot;,\n      &quot;Condition&quot;: {\n        &quot;Null&quot;: {\n          &quot;aws:ResourceTag/elbv2.k8s.aws/cluster&quot;: &quot;false&quot;\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:CreateLoadBalancer&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:CreateTargetGroup&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;*&quot;,\n      &quot;Condition&quot;: {\n        &quot;Null&quot;: {\n          &quot;aws:RequestTag/elbv2.k8s.aws/cluster&quot;: &quot;false&quot;\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:CreateListener&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DeleteListener&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:CreateRule&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DeleteRule&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;*&quot;\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:AddTags&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:RemoveTags&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: [\n        &quot;arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:*:*:targetgroup/*/*&quot;,\n        &quot;arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:*:*:loadbalancer/net/*/*&quot;,\n        &quot;arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:*:*:loadbalancer/app/*/*&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Condition&quot;: {\n        &quot;Null&quot;: {\n          &quot;aws:RequestTag/elbv2.k8s.aws/cluster&quot;: &quot;true&quot;,\n          &quot;aws:ResourceTag/elbv2.k8s.aws/cluster&quot;: &quot;false&quot;\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:AddTags&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:RemoveTags&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: [\n        &quot;arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:*:*:listener/net/*/*/*&quot;,\n        &quot;arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:*:*:listener/app/*/*/*&quot;,\n        &quot;arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:*:*:listener-rule/net/*/*/*&quot;,\n        &quot;arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:*:*:listener-rule/app/*/*/*&quot;\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:ModifyLoadBalancerAttributes&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:SetIpAddressType&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:SetSecurityGroups&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:SetSubnets&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DeleteLoadBalancer&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:ModifyTargetGroup&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:ModifyTargetGroupAttributes&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DeleteTargetGroup&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:ModifyListenerAttributes&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:ModifyCapacityReservation&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:ModifyIpPools&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;*&quot;,\n      &quot;Condition&quot;: {\n        &quot;Null&quot;: {\n          &quot;aws:ResourceTag/elbv2.k8s.aws/cluster&quot;: &quot;false&quot;\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:AddTags&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: [\n        &quot;arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:*:*:targetgroup/*/*&quot;,\n        &quot;arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:*:*:loadbalancer/net/*/*&quot;,\n        &quot;arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:*:*:loadbalancer/app/*/*&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Condition&quot;: {\n        &quot;StringEquals&quot;: {\n          &quot;elasticloadbalancing:CreateAction&quot;: [\n            &quot;CreateTargetGroup&quot;,\n            &quot;CreateLoadBalancer&quot;\n          ]\n        },\n        &quot;Null&quot;: {\n          &quot;aws:RequestTag/elbv2.k8s.aws/cluster&quot;: &quot;false&quot;\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:RegisterTargets&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:DeregisterTargets&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;arn:aws:elasticloadbalancing:*:*:targetgroup/*/*&quot;\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:SetWebAcl&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:ModifyListener&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:AddListenerCertificates&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:RemoveListenerCertificates&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:ModifyRule&quot;,\n        &quot;elasticloadbalancing:SetRulePriorities&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;*&quot;\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_iam_policies_argo_repo_role_json":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">{\n  &quot;Version&quot;: &quot;2012-10-17&quot;,\n  &quot;Statement&quot;: [\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;s3:GetBucketLocation&quot;,\n        &quot;s3:ListBucket&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;arn:aws:s3:::demo-s3-bck&quot;\n    },\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Action&quot;: [\n        &quot;s3:GetObject&quot;\n      ],\n      &quot;Resource&quot;: &quot;arn:aws:s3:::demo-s3-bck/*&quot;\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_iam_policies_trust_policy_template_json":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">{\n  &quot;Version&quot;: &quot;2012-10-17&quot;,\n  &quot;Statement&quot;: [\n    {\n      &quot;Effect&quot;: &quot;Allow&quot;,\n      &quot;Principal&quot;: { &quot;Federated&quot;: &quot;__OIDC_PROVIDER_ARN__&quot; },\n      &quot;Action&quot;: &quot;sts:AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity&quot;,\n      &quot;Condition&quot;: {\n        &quot;StringEquals&quot;: {\n          &quot;__OIDC_PROVIDER__:sub&quot;: &quot;system:serviceaccount:__NAMESPACE__:__SERVICE_ACCOUNT__&quot;,\n          &quot;__OIDC_PROVIDER__:aud&quot;: &quot;sts.amazonaws.com&quot;\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_iam_variable_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">variable &quot;oidc_provider_arn&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;oidc_provider_url&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;argo_namespace&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;argo_sa_name&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;argo_role_name&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;argo_policy_name&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;s3_bucket_arn&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;alb_namespace&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;alb_sa_name&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;alb_role_name&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;alb_policy_name&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_networking_outputs_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">output &quot;vpc_id&quot; {\n  description = &quot;ID of the provisioned VPC&quot;\n  value       = aws_vpc.main.id\n}\n\noutput &quot;vpc_cidr&quot; {\n  description = &quot;CIDR block assigned to the VPC&quot;\n  value       = aws_vpc.main.cidr_block\n}\n\noutput &quot;public_subnet_ids&quot; {\n  description = &quot;Public subnet IDs ordered by the provided AZ list&quot;\n  value       = [for az in local.azs : aws_subnet.public[az].id]\n}\n\noutput &quot;private_subnet_ids&quot; {\n  description = &quot;Private subnet IDs ordered by the provided AZ list&quot;\n  value       = [for az in local.azs : aws_subnet.private[az].id]\n}\n\noutput &quot;public_subnet_cidrs&quot; {\n  description = &quot;CIDR blocks used by each public subnet (ordered by AZ list)&quot;\n  value       = [for az in local.azs : aws_subnet.public[az].cidr_block]\n}\n\noutput &quot;private_subnet_cidrs&quot; {\n  description = &quot;CIDR blocks used by each private subnet (ordered by AZ list)&quot;\n  value       = [for az in local.azs : aws_subnet.private[az].cidr_block]\n}\n\noutput &quot;public_route_table_id&quot; {\n  description = &quot;Route table ID handling public subnets&quot;\n  value       = aws_route_table.public.id\n}\n\noutput &quot;private_route_table_ids&quot; {\n  description = &quot;Route table IDs associated with private subnets&quot;\n  value       = aws_route_table.private[*].id\n}\n\noutput &quot;internet_gateway_id&quot; {\n  description = &quot;ID of the Internet Gateway attached to the VPC&quot;\n  value       = aws_internet_gateway.main.id\n}\n\noutput &quot;nat_gateway_ids&quot; {\n  description = &quot;IDs of created NAT Gateways&quot;\n  value       = aws_nat_gateway.main[*].id\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_networking_variable_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">variable &quot;region&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;ap-northeast-2&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;vpc_cidr&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n\nvariable &quot;azs&quot; {\n  type = list(string)\n}\n\nvariable &quot;subnet_count&quot; {\n  type = number\n}\n\nvariable &quot;nat_gw_per_subnet&quot; {\n  type    = bool\n  default = true\n}\n\nvariable &quot;cluster_name&quot; {\n  type = string\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_modules_networking_vpc_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">locals {\n  azs = [for az in var.azs : &quot;${var.region}${az}&quot;]\n\n  private_subnet_cidrs = [for i in range(var.subnet_count) : cidrsubnet(var.vpc_cidr, 8, i)]\n  public_subnet_cidrs  = [for i in range(var.subnet_count) : cidrsubnet(var.vpc_cidr, 8, var.subnet_count + i)]\n}\n\n# VPC\nresource &quot;aws_vpc&quot; &quot;main&quot; {\n  cidr_block           = var.vpc_cidr\n  enable_dns_hostnames = true\n  enable_dns_support   = true\n\n  tags = {\n    Name = &quot;argo-vpc&quot;\n  }\n}\n\n# Subnets\nresource &quot;aws_subnet&quot; &quot;public&quot; {\n  for_each = toset(local.azs)\n\n  vpc_id                  = aws_vpc.main.id\n  cidr_block              = local.public_subnet_cidrs[index(local.azs, each.key)]\n  availability_zone       = each.key\n  map_public_ip_on_launch = true\n\n  tags = {\n    Name                                        = &quot;argo-public-${var.azs[index(local.azs, each.key)]}&quot;\n    &quot;kubernetes.io/role/elb&quot;                    = &quot;1&quot;\n    &quot;kubernetes.io/cluster/${var.cluster_name}&quot; = &quot;shared&quot;\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_subnet&quot; &quot;private&quot; {\n  for_each = toset(local.azs)\n\n  vpc_id                  = aws_vpc.main.id\n  cidr_block              = local.private_subnet_cidrs[index(local.azs, each.key)]\n  availability_zone       = each.key\n  map_public_ip_on_launch = false\n\n  tags = {\n    Name                                        = &quot;argo-private-${var.azs[index(local.azs, each.key)]}&quot;\n    &quot;kubernetes.io/role/internal-elb&quot;           = &quot;1&quot;\n    &quot;kubernetes.io/cluster/${var.cluster_name}&quot; = &quot;shared&quot;\n  }\n}\n\n# Gateways\nresource &quot;aws_internet_gateway&quot; &quot;main&quot; {\n  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id\n\n  tags = {\n    Name = &quot;argo-igw&quot;\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_eip&quot; &quot;nat&quot; {\n  count      = var.nat_gw_per_subnet ? var.subnet_count : 1\n  domain     = &quot;vpc&quot;\n  depends_on = [aws_internet_gateway.main]\n\n  tags = {\n    Name = &quot;argo-nat-eip-${var.azs[count.index]}&quot;\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_nat_gateway&quot; &quot;main&quot; {\n  count         = var.nat_gw_per_subnet ? var.subnet_count : 1\n  allocation_id = aws_eip.nat[count.index].id\n  subnet_id     = aws_subnet.public[local.azs[count.index]].id\n\n  tags = {\n    Name = &quot;argo-nat-gateway-${var.azs[count.index]}&quot;\n  }\n\n  depends_on = [aws_internet_gateway.main]\n}\n\n# Routing tables and Routes\nresource &quot;aws_route_table&quot; &quot;public&quot; {\n  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id\n\n  tags = {\n    Name = &quot;argo-public-rt&quot;\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_route_table_association&quot; &quot;public&quot; {\n  count = var.subnet_count\n\n  subnet_id      = aws_subnet.public[local.azs[count.index]].id\n  route_table_id = aws_route_table.public.id\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_route&quot; &quot;public_internet&quot; {\n  route_table_id         = aws_route_table.public.id\n  destination_cidr_block = &quot;0.0.0.0/0&quot;\n  gateway_id             = aws_internet_gateway.main.id\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_route_table&quot; &quot;private&quot; {\n  count  = var.nat_gw_per_subnet ? var.subnet_count : 1\n  vpc_id = aws_vpc.main.id\n\n  tags = {\n    Name = var.nat_gw_per_subnet ? &quot;argo-private-${var.azs[count.index]}-rt&quot; : &quot;argo-private-rt&quot;\n  }\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_route_table_association&quot; &quot;private&quot; {\n  count          = var.nat_gw_per_subnet ? var.subnet_count : 1\n  subnet_id      = aws_subnet.private[local.azs[count.index]].id\n  route_table_id = aws_route_table.private[count.index].id\n}\n\nresource &quot;aws_route&quot; &quot;private_nat&quot; {\n  count                  = var.nat_gw_per_subnet ? var.subnet_count : 1\n  route_table_id         = aws_route_table.private[count.index].id\n  destination_cidr_block = &quot;0.0.0.0/0&quot;\n  nat_gateway_id         = aws_nat_gateway.main[count.index].id\n\n  depends_on = [aws_nat_gateway.main]\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_outputs_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">output &quot;chart_bucket_arn&quot; {\n  value = resource.aws_s3_bucket.helm_chart_bucket.arn\n}\n\noutput &quot;chart_bucket_name&quot; {\n  value = resource.aws_s3_bucket.helm_chart_bucket.bucket\n}\n\noutput &quot;chart_bucket_id&quot; {\n  value = resource.aws_s3_bucket.helm_chart_bucket.id\n}\n\noutput &quot;vpc_id&quot; {\n  value = module.networking.vpc_id\n}\n\noutput &quot;public_subnet_ids&quot; {\n  value = module.networking.public_subnet_ids\n}\n\noutput &quot;private_subnet_ids&quot; {\n  value = module.networking.private_subnet_ids\n}\n\noutput &quot;eks_cluster_name&quot; {\n  value = module.container.cluster_name\n}\n\noutput &quot;eks_cluster_arn&quot; {\n  value = module.container.cluster_arn\n}\n\noutput &quot;eks_cluster_endpoint&quot; {\n  value = module.container.cluster_endpoint\n}\n\noutput &quot;eks_oidc_provider_arn&quot; {\n  value = module.container.oidc_provider_arn\n}\n\noutput &quot;argocd_repo_role_arn&quot; {\n  value = module.iam.argocd_repo_role_arn\n}\n\noutput &quot;alb_controller_role_arn&quot; {\n  value = module.iam.alb_controller_role_arn\n}\n\noutput &quot;ecr_backend_repository_url&quot; {\n  value = module.container.ecr_backend_repository_url\n}\n\noutput &quot;ecr_frontend_repository_url&quot; {\n  value = module.container.ecr_frontend_repository_url\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_provider_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">terraform {\n  required_version = &quot;&gt;= 1.14.0&quot;\n\n  required_providers {\n    aws = {\n      source  = &quot;hashicorp/aws&quot;\n      version = &quot;&gt;= 5.0&quot;\n    }\n    tls = {\n      source  = &quot;hashicorp/tls&quot;\n      version = &quot;&gt;= 4.0&quot;\n    }\n  }\n\n  backend &quot;s3&quot; {\n    bucket = &quot;juany-wsk-tfstate&quot;\n    key    = &quot;argocd-s3-helm/terraform.state&quot;\n    region = &quot;ap-northeast-2&quot;\n  }\n}\n\nprovider &quot;aws&quot; {\n  region = var.region\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main__infra_variable_tf":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">variable &quot;region&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;ap-northeast-2&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;cluster_name&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;argo-eks-cluster&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;vpc_cidr&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;10.1.0.0/16&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;azs&quot; {\n  type    = list(string)\n  default = [&quot;a&quot;, &quot;c&quot;]\n}\n\nvariable &quot;subnet_count&quot; {\n  type    = number\n  default = 2\n}\n\nvariable &quot;nat_gw_per_subnet&quot; {\n  type    = bool\n  default = true\n}\n\nvariable &quot;eks_version&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;1.34&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;public_access_cidrs&quot; {\n  type    = list(string)\n  default = [&quot;0.0.0.0/0&quot;]\n}\n\nvariable &quot;node_instance_type&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;t3.medium&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;node_desired_size&quot; {\n  type    = number\n  default = 2\n}\n\nvariable &quot;node_min_size&quot; {\n  type    = number\n  default = 1\n}\n\nvariable &quot;node_max_size&quot; {\n  type    = number\n  default = 4\n}\n\nvariable &quot;argo_namespace&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;argocd&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;argo_sa_name&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;argocd-repo-server&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;argo_role_name&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;argocd-repo-server-irsa&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;argo_policy_name&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;argocd-repo-server-policy&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;alb_namespace&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;kube-system&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;alb_sa_name&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;aws-load-balancer-controller&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;alb_role_name&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;aws-load-balancer-controller-irsa&quot;\n}\n\nvariable &quot;alb_policy_name&quot; {\n  type    = string\n  default = &quot;aws-load-balancer-controller-policy&quot;\n}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_backend__github_workflows_ci_yml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">name: Backend CI to ECR\n\non:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n  push:\n    branches: [ main ]\n\njobs:\n  build-and-push:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout code\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      \n      - name: Generate image tag\n        id: tag\n        run: |\n          TIMESTAMP=$(date -u +%Y%m%d%H%M%S)\n          SHORT_SHA=$(echo ${{ github.sha }} | cut -c1-6)\n          IMAGE_TAG=&quot;${TIMESTAMP}-${SHORT_SHA}&quot;\n          echo &quot;IMAGE_TAG=${IMAGE_TAG}&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n          echo &quot;Generated tag: ${IMAGE_TAG}&quot;\n      \n      - name: Configure AWS credentials\n        uses: aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v4\n        with:\n          aws-access-key-id: ${{ secrets.AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID }}\n          aws-secret-access-key: ${{ secrets.AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY }}\n          aws-region: ${{ secrets.AWS_REGION }}\n      \n      - name: Login to Amazon ECR\n        id: ecr-login\n        uses: aws-actions/amazon-ecr-login@v2\n      \n      - name: Build and push image\n        env:\n          ECR_REGISTRY: ${{ steps.ecr-login.outputs.registry }}\n          ECR_REPOSITORY: ${{ secrets.ECR_REPOSITORY_BACKEND }}\n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ steps.tag.outputs.IMAGE_TAG }}\n        run: |\n          docker build -t &quot;$ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG&quot; .\n          docker push &quot;$ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG&quot;\n          echo &quot;Pushed image: $ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG&quot;\n      \n      - name: Checkout devops repo\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          repository: ${{ secrets.DEVOPS_REPO }}  # e.g., your-org/devops\n          token: ${{ secrets.DEVOPS_REPO_TOKEN }}\n          path: devops\n      \n      - name: Update devops values\n        env:\n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ steps.tag.outputs.IMAGE_TAG }}\n          ECR_REGISTRY: ${{ steps.ecr-login.outputs.registry }}\n          ECR_REPOSITORY: ${{ secrets.ECR_REPOSITORY_BACKEND }}\n        run: |\n          cd devops\n          sed -i &quot;s|tag: .*|tag: ${IMAGE_TAG}|g&quot; backend.values.yaml\n          sed -i &quot;s|repository: .*|repository: ${ECR_REGISTRY}/${ECR_REPOSITORY}|g&quot; backend.values.yaml\n      \n      - name: Commit and push to devops repo\n        env:\n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ steps.tag.outputs.IMAGE_TAG }}\n        run: |\n          cd devops\n          git config --global user.name &quot;github-actions[bot]&quot;\n          git config --global user.email &quot;github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com&quot;\n          git add backend.values.yaml\n          git commit -m &quot;chore: update backend image to ${IMAGE_TAG}&quot; || echo &quot;No changes to commit&quot;\n          git push\n          echo &quot;ArgoCD will sync within 3 minutes&quot;\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_backend_Dockerfile":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">FROM python:3.12-slim\n\nWORKDIR /app\n\n# Install uv\nRUN pip install --no-cache-dir uv\n\n# Copy project files\nCOPY pyproject.toml .\nCOPY main.py .\n\n# Install dependencies using uv\nRUN uv sync --no-install-project --no-dev\n\n# Expose port\nEXPOSE 8080\n\n# Run the application\nCMD [&quot;uv&quot;, &quot;run&quot;, &quot;uvicorn&quot;, &quot;main:app&quot;, &quot;--host&quot;, &quot;0.0.0.0&quot;, &quot;--port&quot;, &quot;8080&quot;]\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_backend_main_py":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">from datetime import datetime, timezone\n\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\n\napp = FastAPI(title=&quot;Backend API&quot;, version=&quot;0.1.0&quot;)\n\n\n@app.get(&quot;/health&quot;)\nasync def health_check():\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;Health check endpoint for Kubernetes probes.&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    return {&quot;status&quot;: &quot;healthy&quot;}\n\n\n@app.get(&quot;/v1/time&quot;)\nasync def get_time():\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;Get current server time in ISO format.&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    now = datetime.now(timezone.utc)\n    return {\n        &quot;timestamp&quot;: now.isoformat(),\n        &quot;unix&quot;: int(now.timestamp()),\n        &quot;timezone&quot;: &quot;UTC&quot;,\n    }\n\n\n@app.get(&quot;/&quot;)\nasync def root():\n    &quot;&quot;&quot;Root endpoint.&quot;&quot;&quot;\n    return {&quot;message&quot;: &quot;Backend API&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;0.1.0&quot;}\n\n\nif __name__ == &quot;__main__&quot;:\n    import uvicorn\n\n    uvicorn.run(app, host=&quot;0.0.0.0&quot;, port=8080)\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_backend_pyproject_toml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">[project]\nname = &quot;backend&quot;\nversion = &quot;0.1.0&quot;\ndescription = &quot;Simple FastAPI backend for demo&quot;\nreadme = { text = &quot;Simple FastAPI backend for demo&quot;, content-type = &quot;text/markdown&quot; }\nrequires-python = &quot;&gt;=3.12&quot;\ndependencies = [\n    &quot;fastapi&quot;,\n    &quot;uvicorn[standard]&quot;,\n]\n\n[build-system]\nrequires = [&quot;hatchling&quot;]\nbuild-backend = &quot;hatchling.build&quot;\n\n[tool.hatch.build.targets.wheel]\npackages = [&quot;.&quot;]\nonly-include = [&quot;main.py&quot;]\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_devops_backend_values_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">replicaCount: 2\n\nimage:\n  repository: 156041424727.dkr.ecr.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/argo-backend\n  tag: v1.0.0\n  pullPolicy: IfNotPresent\n\nnameOverride: backend\nfullnameOverride: &quot;&quot;\n\ncontainerPort: 8080\n\nservice:\n  type: ClusterIP\n  port: 8080\n\nenv: []\n\nresources:\n  limits:\n    cpu: 500m\n    memory: 512Mi\n  requests:\n    cpu: 100m\n    memory: 128Mi\n\nlivenessProbe:\n  enabled: true\n  httpGet:\n    path: /health\n    port: http\n  initialDelaySeconds: 30\n  periodSeconds: 10\n\nreadinessProbe:\n  enabled: true\n  httpGet:\n    path: /health\n    port: http\n  initialDelaySeconds: 10\n  periodSeconds: 5\n\nrollout:\n  strategy: blueGreen\n  \n  blueGreen:\n    activeService: &quot;&quot;\n    previewService: &quot;&quot;\n    autoPromotionEnabled: false\n    autoPromotionSeconds: 30\n    scaleDownDelaySeconds: 30\n    previewReplicaCount: 1</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_devops_frontend_values_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">replicaCount: 2\n\nimage:\n  repository: 156041424727.dkr.ecr.ap-northeast-2.amazonaws.com/argo-frontend\n  tag: v1.0.0\n  pullPolicy: IfNotPresent\n\nnameOverride: frontend\nfullnameOverride: &quot;&quot;\n\ncontainerPort: 80\n\nservice:\n  type: ClusterIP\n  port: 80\n\nenv: []\n\nresources:\n  limits:\n    cpu: 200m\n    memory: 256Mi\n  requests:\n    cpu: 50m\n    memory: 64Mi\n\nlivenessProbe:\n  enabled: true\n  httpGet:\n    path: /\n    port: http\n  initialDelaySeconds: 10\n  periodSeconds: 10\n\nreadinessProbe:\n  enabled: true\n  httpGet:\n    path: /\n    port: http\n  initialDelaySeconds: 5\n  periodSeconds: 5\n\nrollout:\n  strategy: canary\n  \n  canary:\n    maxSurge: &quot;25%&quot;\n    maxUnavailable: 0\n    steps:\n      - setWeight: 20\n      - pause: {duration: 30s}\n      - setWeight: 40\n      - pause: {duration: 30s}\n      - setWeight: 60\n      - pause: {duration: 30s}\n      - setWeight: 80\n      - pause: {duration: 30s}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_devops_kustomization_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: kustomize.config.k8s.io/v1beta1\nkind: Kustomization\nresources:\n  - manifests/ingress.yaml\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_devops_manifests_ingress_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: Ingress\nmetadata:\n  name: shared-ingress\n  namespace: app\n  annotations:\n    kubernetes.io/ingress.class: alb\n    alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/scheme: internet-facing\n    alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/target-type: ip\n    alb.ingress.kubernetes.io/listen-ports: &#x27;[{&quot;HTTP&quot;: 80}]&#x27;\nspec:\n  rules:\n    - http:\n        paths:\n          - path: /\n            pathType: Prefix\n            backend:\n              service:\n                name: frontend\n                port:\n                  number: 80\n          - path: /v1\n            pathType: Prefix\n            backend:\n              service:\n                name: backend\n                port:\n                  number: 8080\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_frontend__github_workflows_ci_yml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">name: Frontend CI to ECR\n\non:\n  workflow_dispatch:\n  push:\n    branches: [ main ]\n\njobs:\n  build-and-push:\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout code\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      \n      - name: Generate image tag\n        id: tag\n        run: |\n          TIMESTAMP=$(date -u +%Y%m%d%H%M%S)\n          SHORT_SHA=$(echo ${{ github.sha }} | cut -c1-6)\n          IMAGE_TAG=&quot;${TIMESTAMP}-${SHORT_SHA}&quot;\n          echo &quot;IMAGE_TAG=${IMAGE_TAG}&quot; &gt;&gt; $GITHUB_OUTPUT\n          echo &quot;Generated tag: ${IMAGE_TAG}&quot;\n      \n      - name: Configure AWS credentials\n        uses: aws-actions/configure-aws-credentials@v4\n        with:\n          aws-access-key-id: ${{ secrets.AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID }}\n          aws-secret-access-key: ${{ secrets.AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY }}\n          aws-region: ${{ secrets.AWS_REGION }}\n      \n      - name: Login to Amazon ECR\n        id: ecr-login\n        uses: aws-actions/amazon-ecr-login@v2\n      \n      - name: Build and push image\n        env:\n          ECR_REGISTRY: ${{ steps.ecr-login.outputs.registry }}\n          ECR_REPOSITORY: ${{ secrets.ECR_REPOSITORY_FRONTEND }}\n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ steps.tag.outputs.IMAGE_TAG }}\n        run: |\n          docker build -t &quot;$ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG&quot; .\n          docker push &quot;$ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG&quot;\n          echo &quot;Pushed image: $ECR_REGISTRY/$ECR_REPOSITORY:$IMAGE_TAG&quot;\n      \n      - name: Checkout devops repo\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n        with:\n          repository: ${{ secrets.DEVOPS_REPO }}  # e.g., your-org/devops\n          token: ${{ secrets.DEVOPS_REPO_TOKEN }}\n          path: devops\n      \n      - name: Update devops values\n        env:\n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ steps.tag.outputs.IMAGE_TAG }}\n          ECR_REGISTRY: ${{ steps.ecr-login.outputs.registry }}\n          ECR_REPOSITORY: ${{ secrets.ECR_REPOSITORY_FRONTEND }}\n        run: |\n          cd devops\n          sed -i &quot;s|tag: .*|tag: ${IMAGE_TAG}|g&quot; frontend.values.yaml\n          sed -i &quot;s|repository: .*|repository: ${ECR_REGISTRY}/${ECR_REPOSITORY}|g&quot; frontend.values.yaml\n      \n      - name: Commit and push to devops repo\n        env:\n          IMAGE_TAG: ${{ steps.tag.outputs.IMAGE_TAG }}\n        run: |\n          cd devops\n          git config --global user.name &quot;github-actions[bot]&quot;\n          git config --global user.email &quot;github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com&quot;\n          git add frontend.values.yaml\n          git commit -m &quot;chore: update frontend image to ${IMAGE_TAG}&quot; || echo &quot;No changes to commit&quot;\n          git push\n          echo &quot;ArgoCD will sync within 3 minutes&quot;\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_applications_frontend_Dockerfile":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">FROM nginx:alpine\n\nCOPY index.html /usr/share/nginx/html/index.html\n\nEXPOSE 80\n\nCMD [&quot;nginx&quot;, &quot;-g&quot;, &quot;daemon off;&quot;]\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_argocd_applications_backend_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Application\nmetadata:\n  name: backend\n  namespace: argocd\n  annotations:\n    argocd.argoproj.io/sync-wave: &quot;1&quot;\nspec:\n  project: default\n  sources:\n    - repoURL: s3://argo-chart-156041424727/helm\n      chart: app\n      targetRevision: 0.1.0\n      helm:\n        releaseName: backend\n        valueFiles:\n          - $values/backend.values.yaml\n    - repoURL: https://github.com/ninejuan/devops\n      targetRevision: HEAD\n      ref: values\n  destination:\n    server: https://kubernetes.default.svc\n    namespace: app\n  syncPolicy:\n    automated:\n      prune: true\n      selfHeal: true\n    syncOptions:\n      - CreateNamespace=true\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_argocd_applications_devops_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Application\nmetadata:\n  name: devops\n  namespace: argocd\n  annotations:\n    argocd.argoproj.io/sync-wave: &quot;0&quot;\nspec:\n  project: default\n  source:\n    repoURL: https://github.com/ninejuan/devops\n    targetRevision: HEAD\n    path: manifests\n  destination:\n    server: https://kubernetes.default.svc\n    namespace: app\n  syncPolicy:\n    automated:\n      prune: true\n      selfHeal: true\n    syncOptions:\n      - CreateNamespace=true\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_argocd_applications_frontend_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Application\nmetadata:\n  name: frontend\n  namespace: argocd\n  annotations:\n    argocd.argoproj.io/sync-wave: &quot;1&quot;\nspec:\n  project: default\n  sources:\n    - repoURL: s3://argo-chart-156041424727/helm\n      chart: app\n      targetRevision: 0.1.0\n      helm:\n        releaseName: frontend\n        valueFiles:\n          - $values/frontend.values.yaml\n    - repoURL: https://github.com/ninejuan/devops\n      targetRevision: HEAD\n      ref: values\n  destination:\n    server: https://kubernetes.default.svc\n    namespace: app\n  syncPolicy:\n    automated:\n      prune: true\n      selfHeal: true\n    syncOptions:\n      - CreateNamespace=true\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_argocd_applications_kustomization_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\"># ArgoCD Applications\n# App-of-Apps 패턴으로 애플리케이션 배포\napiVersion: kustomize.config.k8s.io/v1beta1\nkind: Kustomization\nnamespace: argocd\nresources:\n  - root.yaml\n  - backend.yaml\n  - frontend.yaml\n  - devops.yaml\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_argocd_applications_root_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Application\nmetadata:\n  name: apps-root\n  namespace: argocd \nspec:\n  project: default\n  source:\n    repoURL: https://github.com/ninejuan/argocd-s3-helm\n    targetRevision: HEAD\n    path: argocd/applications\n  destination:\n    server: https://kubernetes.default.svc\n    namespace: argocd\n  syncPolicy:\n    automated:\n      prune: true\n      selfHeal: true\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_argocd_base_kustomization_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\"># ArgoCD Base Installation\n# CRD 및 기본 리소스 설치\napiVersion: kustomize.config.k8s.io/v1beta1\nkind: Kustomization\nnamespace: argocd\n\nresources:\n  - namespace.yaml\n  - https://raw.githubusercontent.com/argoproj/argo-cd/stable/manifests/install.yaml\n\npatches:\n  - path: patch/s3-helm-repo-secret.yaml\n  - path: patch/repo-server-irsa-sa.yaml\n  - target:\n      kind: ConfigMap\n      name: argocd-cm\n    patch: |-\n      - op: add\n        path: /data/timeout.reconciliation\n        value: &quot;180s&quot;\n\n# GitHub App을 통한 Private Repo 접근\n# secrets/github-app.pem 파일과 github-app-{argocd,devops}-config 파일 필요\nsecretGenerator:\n  - name: github-app-argocd\n    namespace: argocd\n    envs:\n      - secrets/github-app-argocd-config\n    files:\n      - githubAppPrivateKey=secrets/github-app.pem\n    options:\n      labels:\n        argocd.argoproj.io/secret-type: repository\n      disableNameSuffixHash: true\n  \n  - name: github-app-devops\n    namespace: argocd\n    envs:\n      - secrets/github-app-devops-config\n    files:\n      - githubAppPrivateKey=secrets/github-app.pem\n    options:\n      labels:\n        argocd.argoproj.io/secret-type: repository\n      disableNameSuffixHash: true\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_argocd_base_namespace_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: v1\nkind: Namespace\nmetadata:\n  name: argocd\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_argocd_base_patch_repo-server-irsa-sa_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: v1\nkind: ServiceAccount\nmetadata:\n  name: argocd-repo-server\n  annotations:\n    eks.amazonaws.com/role-arn: arn:aws:iam::156041424727:role/argocd-repo-server-irsa\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_argocd_base_patch_s3-helm-repo-secret_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: argocd-repo-server\nspec:\n  template:\n    spec:\n      volumes:\n        - name: helm-working-dir\n          emptyDir: {}\n      initContainers:\n        - name: install-helm-s3\n          image: alpine/helm:3.16.1\n          command: [&quot;/bin/sh&quot;, &quot;-c&quot;]\n          args:\n            - |\n              set -e\n              helm plugin install https://github.com/hypnoglow/helm-s3.git\n              rm -rf /helm-working-dir/plugins/https-github.com-hypnoglow-helm-s3.git;\n              chmod -R 777 &quot;$HELM_DATA_HOME&quot;\n          env:\n            - name: HELM_CACHE_HOME\n              value: /helm-working-dir\n            - name: HELM_CONFIG_HOME\n              value: /helm-working-dir\n            - name: HELM_DATA_HOME\n              value: /helm-working-dir\n          volumeMounts:\n            - name: helm-working-dir\n              mountPath: /helm-working-dir\n      containers:\n        - name: argocd-repo-server\n          env:\n            - name: HELM_CACHE_HOME\n              value: /helm-working-dir\n            - name: HELM_CONFIG_HOME\n              value: /helm-working-dir\n            - name: HELM_DATA_HOME\n              value: /helm-working-dir\n            - name: HELM_PLUGINS\n              value: /helm-working-dir/plugins\n          volumeMounts:\n            - name: helm-working-dir\n              mountPath: /helm-working-dir\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_argocd_base_secrets_github-app-config_example":"<pre class=\"rawtext\"># GitHub App Configuration Example\n# Copy this to github-app-config and fill in your values\n# Format: key=value (no spaces around =)\n\n# argocd-s3-helm repo, devops repo를 모두 사용합니다.\n# github-app-argocd-config, github-app-devops-config 파일명을 사용하시기 바랍니다.\n\ntype=git\nurl=https://github.com/juany-cloud-skills/demo-devops\ngithubAppID=123456\ngithubAppInstallationID=12345678\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_app_Chart_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: v2\nname: app\ndescription: A flexible Helm chart for deploying applications with Argo Rollouts support\n\ntype: application\n\nversion: 0.1.0\n\nappVersion: &quot;1.0.0&quot;\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_app_templates_ingress_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">{{- if .Values.ingress.enabled -}}\napiVersion: networking.k8s.io/v1\nkind: Ingress\nmetadata:\n  name: {{ include &quot;app.fullname&quot; . }}\n  labels:\n    {{- include &quot;app.labels&quot; . | nindent 4 }}\n  {{- with .Values.ingress.annotations }}\n  annotations:\n    {{- toYaml . | nindent 4 }}\n  {{- end }}\nspec:\n  {{- if .Values.ingress.className }}\n  ingressClassName: {{ .Values.ingress.className }}\n  {{- end }}\n  {{- if .Values.ingress.tls }}\n  tls:\n    {{- range .Values.ingress.tls }}\n    - hosts:\n        {{- range .hosts }}\n        - {{ . | quote }}\n        {{- end }}\n      secretName: {{ .secretName }}\n    {{- end }}\n  {{- end }}\n  rules:\n    {{- range .Values.ingress.hosts }}\n    - host: {{ .host | quote }}\n      http:\n        paths:\n          {{- range .paths }}\n          - path: {{ .path }}\n            pathType: {{ .pathType }}\n            backend:\n              service:\n                name: {{ include &quot;app.fullname&quot; $ }}\n                port:\n                  number: {{ $.Values.service.port }}\n          {{- end }}\n    {{- end }}\n{{- end }}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_app_templates_rollout_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: argoproj.io/v1alpha1\nkind: Rollout\nmetadata:\n  name: {{ include &quot;app.fullname&quot; . }}\n  labels:\n    {{- include &quot;app.labels&quot; . | nindent 4 }}\nspec:\n  replicas: {{ .Values.replicaCount }}\n  revisionHistoryLimit: 3\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      {{- include &quot;app.selectorLabels&quot; . | nindent 6 }}\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      labels:\n        {{- include &quot;app.selectorLabels&quot; . | nindent 8 }}\n    spec:\n      containers:\n      - name: {{ .Chart.Name }}\n        image: &quot;{{ .Values.image.repository }}:{{ .Values.image.tag | default .Chart.AppVersion }}&quot;\n        imagePullPolicy: {{ .Values.image.pullPolicy }}\n        ports:\n        - name: http\n          containerPort: {{ .Values.containerPort }}\n          protocol: TCP\n        {{- if .Values.env }}\n        env:\n          {{- toYaml .Values.env | nindent 12 }}\n        {{- end }}\n        {{- if .Values.livenessProbe.enabled }}\n        livenessProbe:\n          httpGet:\n            path: {{ .Values.livenessProbe.httpGet.path }}\n            port: http\n          initialDelaySeconds: {{ .Values.livenessProbe.initialDelaySeconds }}\n          periodSeconds: {{ .Values.livenessProbe.periodSeconds }}\n        {{- end }}\n        {{- if .Values.readinessProbe.enabled }}\n        readinessProbe:\n          httpGet:\n            path: {{ .Values.readinessProbe.httpGet.path }}\n            port: http\n          initialDelaySeconds: {{ .Values.readinessProbe.initialDelaySeconds }}\n          periodSeconds: {{ .Values.readinessProbe.periodSeconds }}\n        {{- end }}\n        resources:\n          {{- toYaml .Values.resources | nindent 12 }}\n  strategy:\n    {{- if eq .Values.rollout.strategy &quot;blueGreen&quot; }}\n    blueGreen:\n      activeService: {{ .Values.rollout.blueGreen.activeService | default (include &quot;app.fullname&quot; .) }}\n      previewService: {{ .Values.rollout.blueGreen.previewService | default (printf &quot;%s-preview&quot; (include &quot;app.fullname&quot; .)) }}\n      autoPromotionEnabled: {{ .Values.rollout.blueGreen.autoPromotionEnabled }}\n      {{- if .Values.rollout.blueGreen.autoPromotionSeconds }}\n      autoPromotionSeconds: {{ .Values.rollout.blueGreen.autoPromotionSeconds }}\n      {{- end }}\n      scaleDownDelaySeconds: {{ .Values.rollout.blueGreen.scaleDownDelaySeconds }}\n      {{- if .Values.rollout.blueGreen.previewReplicaCount }}\n      previewReplicaCount: {{ .Values.rollout.blueGreen.previewReplicaCount }}\n      {{- end }}\n    {{- else if eq .Values.rollout.strategy &quot;canary&quot; }}\n    canary:\n      maxSurge: {{ .Values.rollout.canary.maxSurge }}\n      maxUnavailable: {{ .Values.rollout.canary.maxUnavailable }}\n      steps:\n        {{- toYaml .Values.rollout.canary.steps | nindent 8 }}\n    {{- end }}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_app_templates_service-preview_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">{{- if eq .Values.rollout.strategy &quot;blueGreen&quot; }}\napiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: {{ .Values.rollout.blueGreen.previewService | default (printf &quot;%s-preview&quot; (include &quot;app.fullname&quot; .)) }}\n  labels:\n    {{- include &quot;app.labels&quot; . | nindent 4 }}\nspec:\n  type: {{ .Values.service.type }}\n  ports:\n  - port: {{ .Values.service.port }}\n    targetPort: http\n    protocol: TCP\n    name: http\n  selector:\n    {{- include &quot;app.selectorLabels&quot; . | nindent 4 }}\n{{- end }}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_app_templates_service_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: v1\nkind: Service\nmetadata:\n  name: {{ include &quot;app.fullname&quot; . }}\n  labels:\n    {{- include &quot;app.labels&quot; . | nindent 4 }}\nspec:\n  type: {{ .Values.service.type }}\n  ports:\n  - port: {{ .Values.service.port }}\n    targetPort: http\n    protocol: TCP\n    name: http\n  selector:\n    {{- include &quot;app.selectorLabels&quot; . | nindent 4 }}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_app_values_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">replicaCount: 1\n\nimage:\n  repository: nginx\n  pullPolicy: IfNotPresent\n  tag: &quot;&quot;\n\nnameOverride: &quot;&quot;\nfullnameOverride: &quot;&quot;\n\ncontainerPort: 80\n\nservice:\n  type: ClusterIP\n  port: 80\n\nenv: []\n\ningress:\n  enabled: false\n  className: &quot;&quot;\n  annotations: {}\n  hosts:\n    - host: chart-example.local\n      paths:\n        - path: /\n          pathType: Prefix\n  tls: []\n\nresources:\n  limits:\n    cpu: 500m\n    memory: 512Mi\n  requests:\n    cpu: 100m\n    memory: 128Mi\n\nlivenessProbe:\n  enabled: true\n  httpGet:\n    path: /health\n    port: http\n  initialDelaySeconds: 30\n  periodSeconds: 10\n\nreadinessProbe:\n  enabled: true\n  httpGet:\n    path: /health\n    port: http\n  initialDelaySeconds: 10\n  periodSeconds: 5\n\n# Argo Rollouts configuration\nrollout:\n  enabled: true\n  strategy: blueGreen  # Options: blueGreen, canary\n  \n  # Blue-Green strategy configuration\n  blueGreen:\n    activeService: &quot;&quot;  # Will be auto-generated if empty\n    previewService: &quot;&quot;  # Will be auto-generated if empty\n    autoPromotionEnabled: false\n    autoPromotionSeconds: 30\n    scaleDownDelaySeconds: 30\n    previewReplicaCount: 1\n    \n  # Canary strategy configuration\n  canary:\n    maxSurge: &quot;25%&quot;\n    maxUnavailable: 0\n    steps:\n      - setWeight: 20\n      - pause: {duration: 30s}\n      - setWeight: 40\n      - pause: {duration: 30s}\n      - setWeight: 60\n      - pause: {duration: 30s}\n      - setWeight: 80\n      - pause: {duration: 30s}\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_index_sh":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#!/bin/bash\nset -e\n\n# ============================================\n# Configuration\n# ============================================\nBUCKET_NAME=&quot;argo-chart-156041424727&quot;\nS3_PATH=&quot;helm&quot;\n\n# ============================================\n# Create Index and Push to S3\n# ============================================\nhelm repo index . --url s3://$BUCKET_NAME/$S3_PATH/\naws s3 cp index.yaml s3://$BUCKET_NAME/$S3_PATH/\n\nrm index.yaml</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_push_sh":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#!/bin/bash\nset -e\n\n# ============================================\n# Configuration\n# ============================================\nBUCKET_NAME=&quot;argo-chart-156041424727&quot;\nREPO_NAME=&quot;argos3-app&quot;\nS3_PATH=&quot;helm&quot;\n\n# ============================================\n# Package and Push Helm Chart to S3\n# ============================================\n\necho &quot;=== Pushing Helm Chart to S3 ===&quot;\necho &quot;Repo: ${REPO_NAME} (s3://${BUCKET_NAME}/${S3_PATH})&quot;\necho &quot;&quot;\n\necho &quot;Packaging chart...&quot;\nhelm package app/\n\necho &quot; Pushing to S3...&quot;\nhelm s3 push app-*.tgz &quot;${REPO_NAME}&quot; --force\n\necho &quot;Cleaning up...&quot;\nrm -f app-*.tgz\n\necho &quot;Done!&quot;\nhelm search repo &quot;${REPO_NAME}&quot;\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_charts_setup_sh":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#!/bin/bash\nset -e\n\n# ============================================\n# Configuration\n# ============================================\nBUCKET_NAME=&quot;argo-chart-156041424727&quot;\nREPO_NAME=&quot;argos3-app&quot;\nS3_PATH=&quot;helm&quot;\n\n# ============================================\n# Setup S3 Helm Repository\n# 1. Install/Update helm-s3 plugin\n# 2. Initialize S3 bucket as Helm repo\n# ============================================\n\necho &quot;=== Setting up S3 Helm Repository ===&quot;\necho &quot;Bucket: s3://${BUCKET_NAME}/${S3_PATH}&quot;\necho &quot;Repo Name: ${REPO_NAME}&quot;\necho &quot;&quot;\n\n# Install or update plugin\necho &quot;Installing/Updating helm-s3 plugin...&quot;\nif helm plugin list | grep -q s3; then\n  echo &quot;Plugin already installed.&quot;\nelse\n  echo &quot;Installing plugin...&quot;\n  helm plugin install https://github.com/hypnoglow/helm-s3.git --verify=false\nfi\n\n# Initialize S3\necho &quot;Initializing S3 repository...&quot;\nhelm s3 init &quot;s3://${BUCKET_NAME}/${S3_PATH}&quot; || echo &quot;Repository already initialized&quot;\n\n# Add or update repo\necho &quot;Adding Helm repository...&quot;\nif helm repo list | grep -q &quot;^${REPO_NAME}&quot;; then\n  echo &quot;Repository already added, updating URL...&quot;\n  helm repo remove &quot;${REPO_NAME}&quot;\nfi\nhelm repo add &quot;${REPO_NAME}&quot; &quot;s3://${BUCKET_NAME}/${S3_PATH}&quot;\nhelm repo update\n\necho &quot;Setup complete!&quot;\necho &quot;&quot;\necho &quot;Next: ./push.sh to upload charts&quot;\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_setup_apply_sh":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\nCLUSTER_NAME=&quot;argo-eks-cluster&quot;\n\naws eks update-kubeconfig --region ap-northeast-2 --name $CLUSTER_NAME\n\necho &quot;=== Installing Cluster Setup Components ===&quot;\necho &quot;&quot;\n\n# Argo Rollouts\necho &quot;Installing Argo Rollouts...&quot;\nkubectl create ns argo-rollouts\nkubectl apply -f https://github.com/argoproj/argo-rollouts/releases/latest/download/install.yaml -n argo-rollouts\n\n# Cert Manager\necho &quot;Installing Cert Manager...&quot;\nkubectl apply -k cert-manager\nkubectl -n cert-manager rollout status deploy/cert-manager\nkubectl -n cert-manager rollout status deploy/cert-manager-webhook\nkubectl -n cert-manager rollout status deploy/cert-manager-cainjector\n\n# AWS Load Balancer Controller\necho &quot;Installing AWS Load Balancer Controller...&quot;\nkubectl apply -k aws-load-balancer-controller\n\n# App namespace\necho &quot;Creating app namespace...&quot;\nkubectl create namespace app --dry-run=client -o yaml | kubectl apply -f -\n\necho &quot;&quot;\necho &quot;Cluster setup complete!&quot;</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_setup_aws-load-balancer-controller_aws-load-balancer-controller-deployment_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: apps/v1\nkind: Deployment\nmetadata:\n  name: aws-load-balancer-controller\n  namespace: kube-system\nspec:\n  template:\n    spec:\n      containers:\n        - name: controller\n          args:\n            - --cluster-name=argo-eks-cluster\n            - --ingress-class=alb\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_setup_aws-load-balancer-controller_aws-load-balancer-controller-sa_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: v1\nkind: ServiceAccount\nmetadata:\n  name: aws-load-balancer-controller\n  namespace: kube-system\n  annotations:\n    eks.amazonaws.com/role-arn: arn:aws:iam::156041424727:role/aws-load-balancer-controller-irsa\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_setup_aws-load-balancer-controller_kustomization_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: kustomize.config.k8s.io/v1beta1\nkind: Kustomization\nresources:\n  - https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/aws-load-balancer-controller/releases/download/v2.17.1/v2_17_1_full.yaml\npatches:\n  - path: aws-load-balancer-controller-sa.yaml\n  - path: aws-load-balancer-controller-deployment.yaml\n</pre>","github-repos_argocd-s3-helm-main_setup_cert-manager_kustomization_yaml":"<pre class=\"rawtext\">apiVersion: kustomize.config.k8s.io/v1beta1\nkind: Kustomization\nresources:\n  - https://github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager/releases/download/v1.19.2/cert-manager.yaml\n</pre>"});